(1080736, 131277, 4859, '<td valign="top">Nice photograph, unique composition.  I think sheets of music might have been better to appear in the top, not only for the obvious use of musical notes, but the lines in the music sheets may have fit into the composition.</td>', 'Nice photograph, unique composition.  I think sheets of music might have been better to appear in the top, not only for the obvious use of musical notes, but the lines in the music sheets may have fit into the composition.', '2004-12-29 00:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
