(1080756, 131305, 4859, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Haven''t seen one of these in a very long time.  The background works with it to.</td>', 'Great idea.  Haven''t seen one of these in a very long time.  The background works with it to.', '2004-12-29 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
