(1080814, 131222, 15511, '<td valign="top">Everything to the rear of the magneto cover is just out of focus, is this intentional? More depth of field, or perhaps focus on the sprocket and pivot bolt to accentuate the mechanical, the cover logo would still be legible, yet not the "focus" of this image...</td>', 'Everything to the rear of the magneto cover is just out of focus, is this intentional? More depth of field, or perhaps focus on the sprocket and pivot bolt to accentuate the mechanical, the cover logo would still be legible, yet not the "focus" of this image...', '2004-12-29 00:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080817, 130950, 23478, '<td valign="top">Good photo.</td>', 'Good photo.', '2004-12-29 00:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080818, 131147, 10658, '<td valign="top">*giggle*  I had the very same idea for this challenge (our yard is tiny so we have one of those).  But I ended up being too lazy to actually take the picture :)  Like they say, "Great minds think alike." so I''ll have to give you a 10 for this.  The colors are all good, obviously fits the challenge, the only thing I''d change would be to move that one bit of grass that is right on top of the name on the mower/cutter as it''s somewhat distracting.</td>', '*giggle*  I had the very same idea for this challenge (our yard is tiny so we have one of those).  But I ended up being too lazy to actually take the picture :)  Like they say, "Great minds think alike." so I''ll have to give you a 10 for this.  The colors are all good, obviously fits the challenge, the only thing I''d change would be to move that one bit of grass that is right on top of the name on the mower/cutter as it''s somewhat distracting.', '2004-12-29 00:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1080820, 130969, 23478, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-12-29 00:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
