(1080838, 130995, 10658, '<td valign="top">Okay, now that is just *breathtaking*!  If I could give you a 15 I certainly would.  Unfortunately I have to settle for a 10.  WOW!</td>', 'Okay, now that is just *breathtaking*!  If I could give you a 15 I certainly would.  Unfortunately I have to settle for a 10.  WOW!', '2004-12-29 00:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
