(1080843, 131224, 4859, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I wonder how you got the pencil to stay standing up long enough to take the photo. Great composition to the photo.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I wonder how you got the pencil to stay standing up long enough to take the photo. Great composition to the photo.', '2004-12-29 01:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
