(1080968, 131346, 30861, '<td valign="top">The composition is very nice, bu8t the lighting and density are working against you. A little softer light, a little more expression in the shadows, would work wonders.</td>', 'The composition is very nice, bu8t the lighting and density are working against you. A little softer light, a little more expression in the shadows, would work wonders.', '2004-12-29 02:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
