(1081058, 130412, 25095, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot, love the tones and concept, little hard to see some of the shadow areas but still very nice, should place high. Good luck</td>', 'I like this one a lot, love the tones and concept, little hard to see some of the shadow areas but still very nice, should place high. Good luck', '2004-12-29 06:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
