(1081063, 131316, 25095, '<td valign="top">I like the concept you were going after and the blue reflection draws your eyes down to see the reverse of the image so your not bored with just the top.  Kind of want to see a little more of the item but that is just me. Good luck.</td>', 'I like the concept you were going after and the blue reflection draws your eyes down to see the reverse of the image so your not bored with just the top.  Kind of want to see a little more of the item but that is just me. Good luck.', '2004-12-29 06:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
