(1081468, 131285, 20679, '<td valign="top">the ricer is certainly mechanical. Would have tried a diffeent composition though getting in closer to the potatoes and excluding the arm. On-camera direct flash creates rather ugly lighting. Perhaps shooting from below as the potato is forced through the ricer would have created a more powerful shot?</td>', 'the ricer is certainly mechanical. Would have tried a diffeent composition though getting in closer to the potatoes and excluding the arm. On-camera direct flash creates rather ugly lighting. Perhaps shooting from below as the potato is forced through the ricer would have created a more powerful shot?', '2004-12-29 12:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081472, 131311, 20679, '<td valign="top">think this is running on electricity so doesn''t fit the challenge. I do like the angle of the shot though.</td>', 'think this is running on electricity so doesn''t fit the challenge. I do like the angle of the shot though.', '2004-12-29 12:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081475, 131185, 20679, '<td valign="top">has to be a Zenit, right? Happy memories and a lovely shot - clear and well lit. Fits the challenge well. 8</td>', 'has to be a Zenit, right? Happy memories and a lovely shot - clear and well lit. Fits the challenge well. 8', '2004-12-29 12:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081497, 131261, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Great exposure and motion.  It would be much stronger if the axis of the pole/reel was diagonal. Good lighting technique and choice of background.  Yellow border seems out of place, try white instead.  Even with the nits, it''s an 8 from me.</td>', 'Cute!  Great exposure and motion.  It would be much stronger if the axis of the pole/reel was diagonal. Good lighting technique and choice of background.  Yellow border seems out of place, try white instead.  Even with the nits, it''s an 8 from me.', '2004-12-29 12:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081502, 130476, 22305, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of a tracker organ, but I would have liked to see the mechanics of the organ not the pipes.</td>', 'Nice picture of a tracker organ, but I would have liked to see the mechanics of the organ not the pipes.', '2004-12-29 12:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081507, 131263, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and compositon with great detail and a subtleness to it too. Excellent work.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and compositon with great detail and a subtleness to it too. Excellent work.', '2004-12-29 12:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
