(1081640, 130636, 28003, '<td valign="top">Not 100% sure what I''m looking at here, even with the title''s help. Interesting composition, but the out-of-focus thing in the foreground is a severe detraction.</td>', 'Not 100% sure what I''m looking at here, even with the title''s help. Interesting composition, but the out-of-focus thing in the foreground is a severe detraction.', '2004-12-29 13:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
