(1081666, 130647, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great picture....what a unique stapler!  It looks like there may be some interpolation on the blue top part of the unit.  The rest of the photo  is very nice.</td>', 'Great picture....what a unique stapler!  It looks like there may be some interpolation on the blue top part of the unit.  The rest of the photo  is very nice.', '2004-12-29 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081667, 130971, 28643, '<td valign="top">looks a bit underexposed...but some more light to help it shine would be great.  Love the intricate patterns that weave amongst themselves in concert together...</td>', 'looks a bit underexposed...but some more light to help it shine would be great.  Love the intricate patterns that weave amongst themselves in concert together...', '2004-12-29 14:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
