(1081671, 131201, 28003, '<td valign="top">High-key shots are tricky to get right... in this case you seem to have lost a lot of the detail on the edges of the gears, which is a shame, because I like the simple composition. A wider depth-of-field might also have helped.</td>', 'High-key shots are tricky to get right... in this case you seem to have lost a lot of the detail on the edges of the gears, which is a shame, because I like the simple composition. A wider depth-of-field might also have helped.', '2004-12-29 14:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081672, 131214, 13113, '<td valign="top">Great! I think it could be a little better if it was kinda clearer on the back but on the other hand it still looks excellent even with the background sort of blurry. II think it looks good either way! Great shot!</td>', 'Great! I think it could be a little better if it was kinda clearer on the back but on the other hand it still looks excellent even with the background sort of blurry. II think it looks good either way! Great shot!', '2004-12-29 14:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081673, 130829, 30861, '<td valign="top">I admire this for the very fundamental take on what it means to be mechanical; a prybar is the original machine, aka "lever". The foreground leaf reall distracts, and I wish the image were more dynamic.</td>', 'I admire this for the very fundamental take on what it means to be mechanical; a prybar is the original machine, aka "lever". The foreground leaf reall distracts, and I wish the image were more dynamic.', '2004-12-29 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081674, 130822, 31213, '<td valign="top">I have to tell you that I wish you had gotten a little more daring with this picture.  I too was thinking about doing a mechanical pencil but the only way to really make it work would be to do something exciting.  Leaving it flat on the table completely horizontal is a little boring in my humble opinion.  Also the focus missed the pencil!<br/> <br/>Good work but get more creative!</td>', 'I have to tell you that I wish you had gotten a little more daring with this picture.  I too was thinking about doing a mechanical pencil but the only way to really make it work would be to do something exciting.  Leaving it flat on the table completely horizontal is a little boring in my humble opinion.  Also the focus missed the pencil! Good work but get more creative!', '2004-12-29 14:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081676, 130970, 13113, '<td valign="top">Nice! I like it but I think it has a little too much light but that''s my opinion. I like it though and it really fits in with the title. Great choice!</td>', 'Nice! I like it but I think it has a little too much light but that''s my opinion. I like it though and it really fits in with the title. Great choice!', '2004-12-29 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081677, 130885, 30818, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I think the apple is a bit too bright.  It looks a little unnaturual.</td>', 'Great shot, but I think the apple is a bit too bright.  It looks a little unnaturual.', '2004-12-29 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081678, 131167, 31213, '<td valign="top">Some kind of wheel, but what is it?</td>', 'Some kind of wheel, but what is it?', '2004-12-29 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
