(1081681, 130940, 28003, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little off - the lower right is underexposed, with a bunch of glare on the left. Might be worth trying with multiple lights, or a more diffuse light.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little off - the lower right is underexposed, with a bunch of glare on the left. Might be worth trying with multiple lights, or a more diffuse light.', '2004-12-29 14:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081684, 130811, 30861, '<td valign="top">extraordinary positive/negative dialogue; first the BG is UP, then the BG is DOWN, it cycles visually. I wish there were better separation between the teeth and the drak BG stripe. A real sleeper of an image.</td>', 'extraordinary positive/negative dialogue; first the BG is UP, then the BG is DOWN, it cycles visually. I wish there were better separation between the teeth and the drak BG stripe. A real sleeper of an image.', '2004-12-29 14:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081685, 130622, 28003, '<td valign="top">What?</td>', 'What?', '2004-12-29 14:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081686, 131326, 13113, '<td valign="top">Nice and I like the way that the picture even looks old. Could have been have been a little more clearer though but other wise, good! Thumbs up!</td>', 'Nice and I like the way that the picture even looks old. Could have been have been a little more clearer though but other wise, good! Thumbs up!', '2004-12-29 14:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081687, 131199, 30818, '<td valign="top">Very Creative!</td>', 'Very Creative!', '2004-12-29 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081689, 130501, 28003, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that the motion blur really helps here. And I''m not sure what the desaturation is for.</td>', 'I don''t know that the motion blur really helps here. And I''m not sure what the desaturation is for.', '2004-12-29 14:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
