(1081712, 130995, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is techincally well-done, but I''m not sure how the stopped motion helps the mechanical theme, besides, we don''t use corkscrews on champagne... For these reasons, I rank it somewhat lower than I''d otherwise do.</td>', 'This is techincally well-done, but I''m not sure how the stopped motion helps the mechanical theme, besides, we don''t use corkscrews on champagne... For these reasons, I rank it somewhat lower than I''d otherwise do.', '2004-12-29 14:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081713, 131277, 13113, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE! I love the photo.</td>', 'VERY NICE! I love the photo.', '2004-12-29 14:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081715, 131260, 30861, '<td valign="top">This appeals in a low-key way. I wish it were sharper.</td>', 'This appeals in a low-key way. I wish it were sharper.', '2004-12-29 14:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081716, 131191, 28643, '<td valign="top">i like the canal and the water effect but something is missing....maybe it needs more contrast so the tones are not so average and closely aligned.</td>', 'i like the canal and the water effect but something is missing....maybe it needs more contrast so the tones are not so average and closely aligned.', '2004-12-29 14:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081720, 131161, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Its refreshing to see someone use the rule of thirds to keep there photo interesting.  I''m glad you didn''t have the cliche shallow depth of field in the picture either.  Very nice, A+.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Its refreshing to see someone use the rule of thirds to keep there photo interesting.  I''m glad you didn''t have the cliche shallow depth of field in the picture either.  Very nice, A+.', '2004-12-29 14:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081721, 130462, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and effect, but lacking in the critical sharpness this sort of image seems to demand.</td>', 'Nice framing and effect, but lacking in the critical sharpness this sort of image seems to demand.', '2004-12-29 14:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081724, 130940, 31213, '<td valign="top">Love the dramatic lighting.  What is it exactly?</td>', 'Love the dramatic lighting.  What is it exactly?', '2004-12-29 14:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081725, 131280, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is creative, but it''s not really singing to me. I''m not sure why.</td>', 'This is creative, but it''s not really singing to me. I''m not sure why.', '2004-12-29 14:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081727, 131212, 28643, '<td valign="top">I love the colors...lots of white space though which might have been intended...I might have tried to get the slicer into the peppers more so I could get them all into a sharp focus with a different DOF....and allow closer cropping to bring the colors into the front of the image...  great idea and colors...love it.</td>', 'I love the colors...lots of white space though which might have been intended...I might have tried to get the slicer into the peppers more so I could get them all into a sharp focus with a different DOF....and allow closer cropping to bring the colors into the front of the image...  great idea and colors...love it.', '2004-12-29 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081730, 130844, 30861, '<td valign="top">fascinating composition, but in need of more sophisticated lighting to make it really get up and dance. the background wires, all that area in the piano body, need soemthign more.</td>', 'fascinating composition, but in need of more sophisticated lighting to make it really get up and dance. the background wires, all that area in the piano body, need soemthign more.', '2004-12-29 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081731, 131219, 31213, '<td valign="top">Small focusing problem.  Good effort.</td>', 'Small focusing problem.  Good effort.', '2004-12-29 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081732, 131278, 28643, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2004-12-29 14:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081733, 131181, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great pic!  Very artistic and well composed.  What kind of background is that?</td>', 'Great pic!  Very artistic and well composed.  What kind of background is that?', '2004-12-29 14:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081734, 131267, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gonna be fascinating to see how this was pulled off within the rules. Give it an "A" for technical wizardry. I just wish the resultant image pleased me more, but my aesthetic reaction is "heh!".</td>', 'Gonna be fascinating to see how this was pulled off within the rules. Give it an "A" for technical wizardry. I just wish the resultant image pleased me more, but my aesthetic reaction is "heh!".', '2004-12-29 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081735, 131120, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the simplicity and the setup.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the simplicity and the setup.', '2004-12-29 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081737, 130254, 31213, '<td valign="top">Great job with the lighting</td>', 'Great job with the lighting', '2004-12-29 14:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081739, 131154, 30861, '<td valign="top">That somebody found and shot a millstone, one of the more ancient mechanical devices, please me no end. The image itself is muddy and diffuse, to my eye.</td>', 'That somebody found and shot a millstone, one of the more ancient mechanical devices, please me no end. The image itself is muddy and diffuse, to my eye.', '2004-12-29 14:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081741, 130707, 28003, '<td valign="top">This would be great if the horse''s face were free of motion blur.</td>', 'This would be great if the horse''s face were free of motion blur.', '2004-12-29 14:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081742, 131278, 31213, '<td valign="top">Like the motion blur.  Adds great action.</td>', 'Like the motion blur.  Adds great action.', '2004-12-29 14:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081744, 131356, 30861, '<td valign="top">Clean and crisp, a little static to my eye.</td>', 'Clean and crisp, a little static to my eye.', '2004-12-29 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081745, 130728, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and composition.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Very nice lighting and composition.  Keep up the good work!', '2004-12-29 14:22:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1081747, 130893, 28643, '<td valign="top">i like it....would like to see some bracketed exposures to see if it changed the outcome...some additional sidelight on the chains might have brought that portion of the image out more...</td>', 'i like it....would like to see some bracketed exposures to see if it changed the outcome...some additional sidelight on the chains might have brought that portion of the image out more...', '2004-12-29 14:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081750, 131314, 30861, '<td valign="top">Cute as hell. I wish there were more "pop" in the horsey, and the tight cropping at bottom is a major flaw to me eye.</td>', 'Cute as hell. I wish there were more "pop" in the horsey, and the tight cropping at bottom is a major flaw to me eye.', '2004-12-29 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081752, 131360, 30861, '<td valign="top">A nice image, but not really "doing" mechanical for me.</td>', 'A nice image, but not really "doing" mechanical for me.', '2004-12-29 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081753, 131262, 28643, '<td valign="top">good shot....i was half expecting a toenail clipping to be laying on the table near it...LOL</td>', 'good shot....i was half expecting a toenail clipping to be laying on the table near it...LOL', '2004-12-29 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081754, 130713, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Like the red.</td>', 'Very nice. Like the red.', '2004-12-29 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081755, 131191, 28003, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure water effect. Good toning and composition as well.</td>', 'Great long exposure water effect. Good toning and composition as well.', '2004-12-29 14:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081756, 131312, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition.</td>', 'Nice simple composition.', '2004-12-29 14:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081757, 131366, 28643, '<td valign="top">a little dark to my liking....i think with right lighting and exposure you could get some great contrast between green patina of objects and the rust forming on their surfaces...</td>', 'a little dark to my liking....i think with right lighting and exposure you could get some great contrast between green patina of objects and the rust forming on their surfaces...', '2004-12-29 14:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081759, 131173, 28003, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but having that much of the foreground out of focus is just a bad idea.</td>', 'Sorry, but having that much of the foreground out of focus is just a bad idea.', '2004-12-29 14:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081760, 131349, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  You wont see this kind of submission twice!</td>', 'Very creative!  You wont see this kind of submission twice!', '2004-12-29 14:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081761, 131364, 28643, '<td valign="top">too many items out of focus for such a busy pic....</td>', 'too many items out of focus for such a busy pic....', '2004-12-29 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081762, 131358, 30861, '<td valign="top">I feel there''s too much negative space at the top. I wish the arc were not tangent to the warm diagonal. The "tabs" lower right are eyetraps for me. Close, but needs fine tuning.</td>', 'I feel there''s too much negative space at the top. I wish the arc were not tangent to the warm diagonal. The "tabs" lower right are eyetraps for me. Close, but needs fine tuning.', '2004-12-29 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081764, 131281, 28003, '<td valign="top">A touch more DOF to bring more of the foreground into focus would really help here.</td>', 'A touch more DOF to bring more of the foreground into focus would really help here.', '2004-12-29 14:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081768, 130812, 28003, '<td valign="top">Thankyou for highlighting the part of this that relates to the challenge, otherwise I wouldn''t have known.</td>', 'Thankyou for highlighting the part of this that relates to the challenge, otherwise I wouldn''t have known.', '2004-12-29 14:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081769, 131301, 28643, '<td valign="top">a faster shutter speed would allow you to see the spokes better and give some pattern in radial form in addition to the rear sprockets....B&amp;W might work as well.</td>', 'a faster shutter speed would allow you to see the spokes better and give some pattern in radial form in addition to the rear sprockets....B&W might work as well.', '2004-12-29 14:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081770, 131212, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and use of color. Might work a little better from a less shallow angle?</td>', 'Nice idea and use of color. Might work a little better from a less shallow angle?', '2004-12-29 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081771, 131266, 28643, '<td valign="top">great focus and cropping...love it</td>', 'great focus and cropping...love it', '2004-12-29 14:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081774, 131346, 28643, '<td valign="top">a little too underexposed for my liking...</td>', 'a little too underexposed for my liking...', '2004-12-29 14:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081775, 130707, 28643, '<td valign="top">wish you could have caught the one horse in still while the remaining was in motion...</td>', 'wish you could have caught the one horse in still while the remaining was in motion...', '2004-12-29 14:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081777, 131360, 28643, '<td valign="top">unique, interesting, engaging patterns...</td>', 'unique, interesting, engaging patterns...', '2004-12-29 14:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081779, 130961, 28643, '<td valign="top">wish it was a bit brighter....but love the contrast and imagery</td>', 'wish it was a bit brighter....but love the contrast and imagery', '2004-12-29 14:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081780, 130963, 28003, '<td valign="top">Your tonal range is a little flat. (Haha - bad musical pun).<br/>Seriously though, I''m sure you could pull a lot more impact out of this picture with some simple curve adjustment.</td>', 'Your tonal range is a little flat. (Haha - bad musical pun).Seriously though, I''m sure you could pull a lot more impact out of this picture with some simple curve adjustment.', '2004-12-29 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081783, 131214, 28643, '<td valign="top">i like it...and the blurred background and nearly blended pvc pipe make the spigot almost appear floating....very cool or i am smoking too much crack these days...LOL</td>', 'i like it...and the blurred background and nearly blended pvc pipe make the spigot almost appear floating....very cool or i am smoking too much crack these days...LOL', '2004-12-29 14:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081785, 130893, 30861, '<td valign="top">a nice massive feel to this chainlift.</td>', 'a nice massive feel to this chainlift.', '2004-12-29 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081786, 131307, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this is the only zipper... Lighting seems a little hartsh to me, composition is sweet.</td>', 'I''m surprised this is the only zipper... Lighting seems a little hartsh to me, composition is sweet.', '2004-12-29 14:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081788, 130964, 30861, '<td valign="top">DOF seems way off to me, the blurred screws/bolts are disturbing me. The relatively crude blue tonalities seem forced. I''d like to see more separation between arc of the upper wrench jaw and the BG.</td>', 'DOF seems way off to me, the blurred screws/bolts are disturbing me. The relatively crude blue tonalities seem forced. I''d like to see more separation between arc of the upper wrench jaw and the BG.', '2004-12-29 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081789, 130825, 30861, '<td valign="top">A striking composition marred by a muddy sense of color. The super-bright, super-centered light is a major distraction. Seems lacking in visual acuity as well.</td>', 'A striking composition marred by a muddy sense of color. The super-bright, super-centered light is a major distraction. Seems lacking in visual acuity as well.', '2004-12-29 14:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081790, 130995, 28643, '<td valign="top">love the energy, the motion and the exposure of the shot....great</td>', 'love the energy, the motion and the exposure of the shot....great', '2004-12-29 14:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081791, 131283, 30861, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple repeating composition, but ultimately it feels sort of static, which it ought not to considering the subject.</td>', 'Clean and simple repeating composition, but ultimately it feels sort of static, which it ought not to considering the subject.', '2004-12-29 14:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081792, 130917, 30861, '<td valign="top">Too high key for me</td>', 'Too high key for me', '2004-12-29 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081793, 130952, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is funny. I like it a lot but it needs more DOF: feet, especially, should be sharp. Ought to be possible too, just by moving the point of critical focus forward a tad. DOF is 1/3 in front and 2/3 behind POCF as a rule of thumb, so there''s some wiggle room here.</td>', 'This is funny. I like it a lot but it needs more DOF: feet, especially, should be sharp. Ought to be possible too, just by moving the point of critical focus forward a tad. DOF is 1/3 in front and 2/3 behind POCF as a rule of thumb, so there''s some wiggle room here.', '2004-12-29 14:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081794, 130647, 30861, '<td valign="top">Looks better in tumbnail than in large size, where lack of sharpness is very apparent.</td>', 'Looks better in tumbnail than in large size, where lack of sharpness is very apparent.', '2004-12-29 14:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081797, 130360, 30890, '<td valign="top">I like this photo for the fact that you have captured the craftsmanship of the watchmaker beautifully</td>', 'I like this photo for the fact that you have captured the craftsmanship of the watchmaker beautifully', '2004-12-29 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081811, 131201, 22479, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure if the strong side lighting and resulting shadows add to the aesthestics of the image. DOF is too shallow and the foremost gear struggles to be in focus. The negative space is a nice touch, and your border is subtle yet effective. Overall a nice enough entry which I think suffers from choice of lighting and depth of field.<br/></td>', 'I''m not so sure if the strong side lighting and resulting shadows add to the aesthestics of the image. DOF is too shallow and the foremost gear struggles to be in focus. The negative space is a nice touch, and your border is subtle yet effective. Overall a nice enough entry which I think suffers from choice of lighting and depth of field.', '2004-12-29 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081814, 130964, 22479, '<td valign="top">I like the toning and overall composition. Background shadow is also pleasing and creates a nice platform on which you presented the subject. Lots of contrast here which is also distinctive and pleasing.</td>', 'I like the toning and overall composition. Background shadow is also pleasing and creates a nice platform on which you presented the subject. Lots of contrast here which is also distinctive and pleasing.', '2004-12-29 15:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081820, 130550, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings :)<br/> <br/>There are a couple items about this image that could use some extra thought.  First of all, the choice of the wooden cutting board as a background for this still life may not have been the best one.  The diagonals are nice in the composition, but the color or the background doesn''t mesh well with the subject.  The composition also feels a little uncomfortable with the handle of the scissors missing in the frame.  That compositional item seems to break the rhythm within the image.  I''m bad about saying this, but I believe this composition would be stronger as a black and white also.  That would eliminate the color conflict.  There is ''conflict'' within the color structure here because your tools have a cool metal color and the board has a warmer feel to it.  <br/> <br/>Just some food for thought :)<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings :) There are a couple items about this image that could use some extra thought.  First of all, the choice of the wooden cutting board as a background for this still life may not have been the best one.  The diagonals are nice in the composition, but the color or the background doesn''t mesh well with the subject.  The composition also feels a little uncomfortable with the handle of the scissors missing in the frame.  That compositional item seems to break the rhythm within the image.  I''m bad about saying this, but I believe this composition would be stronger as a black and white also.  That would eliminate the color conflict.  There is ''conflict'' within the color structure here because your tools have a cool metal color and the board has a warmer feel to it.   Just some food for thought :) John Setzler', '2004-12-29 15:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081826, 130450, 22479, '<td valign="top">Couple of things here which is not working...the shear distortion introduced into this image probably as a result of deliberate post processing does not add to this image in a meaningful way (aside from being a purely artistic decision). The second is the size of this entry. It''s thumbnail sized and makes judging it quite difficult. Try submitting an image that is 600+ pixels on the long edge.</td>', 'Couple of things here which is not working...the shear distortion introduced into this image probably as a result of deliberate post processing does not add to this image in a meaningful way (aside from being a purely artistic decision). The second is the size of this entry. It''s thumbnail sized and makes judging it quite difficult. Try submitting an image that is 600+ pixels on the long edge.', '2004-12-29 15:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081841, 130695, 28643, '<td valign="top">looks like the Yashica my dad had when I was young...i remember the two lights on top unless others did that as well.</td>', 'looks like the Yashica my dad had when I was young...i remember the two lights on top unless others did that as well.', '2004-12-29 15:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081862, 130691, 31076, '<td valign="top">Holiday cheer. Good stuff.</td>', 'Holiday cheer. Good stuff.', '2004-12-29 15:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081868, 131351, 31076, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, lighting, and contrast between the red, silver, and black. Excellent.<br/>Looks like a lot of people used a corkscrew for their subject. I found that interesting,. and not to mention festive as well. hehe.</td>', 'I like the colors, lighting, and contrast between the red, silver, and black. Excellent.Looks like a lot of people used a corkscrew for their subject. I found that interesting,. and not to mention festive as well. hehe.', '2004-12-29 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081876, 130995, 31076, '<td valign="top">This show the relaxing side of New Years. Sexual in so many ways.</td>', 'This show the relaxing side of New Years. Sexual in so many ways.', '2004-12-29 15:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081878, 130201, 19708, '<td valign="top">Quite the moment cuaght here, or is it really from a unit out of the car (no reflections from plastic bezel).<br/>A slight CCW rotation would have helped.</td>', 'Quite the moment cuaght here, or is it really from a unit out of the car (no reflections from plastic bezel).A slight CCW rotation would have helped.', '2004-12-29 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1081884, 131194, 19708, '<td valign="top">Looks like a crankshaft &amp; Camshaft from a one-cylinder engine.<br/>A bit too much image compression or neat image applied. A minor CCW rotation and crop to remove the angled wood in the top left would have helped here.</td>', 'Looks like a crankshaft & Camshaft from a one-cylinder engine.A bit too much image compression or neat image applied. A minor CCW rotation and crop to remove the angled wood in the top left would have helped here.', '2004-12-29 15:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
