(1082005, 130995, 31214, '<td valign="top">This photo is superb!  There''s so much energy caught.  the addition of twinkling stars adds a lot to the festive mood.  You can even read the cork.  As the champagne bounces off of everything, with the background, it appears to create a starry night!  I would love to hear how you did this shot.  My only 10!</td>', 'This photo is superb!  There''s so much energy caught.  the addition of twinkling stars adds a lot to the festive mood.  You can even read the cork.  As the champagne bounces off of everything, with the background, it appears to create a starry night!  I would love to hear how you did this shot.  My only 10!', '2004-12-29 16:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082008, 131368, 31214, '<td valign="top">I especially like the shadow work.  Very nice set up.<br/> <br/>A little wash out where the screw enters the cork.  Good job.</td>', 'I especially like the shadow work.  Very nice set up. A little wash out where the screw enters the cork.  Good job.', '2004-12-29 16:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
