(1082011, 131191, 31214, '<td valign="top">I love the "balance" to this shot.  great job on bringing out a smooth water flow that sets the "feel" for the photo.  Since there''s so much symetry, perhaps crop out those elements which are not symetrical (top right).</td>', 'I love the "balance" to this shot.  great job on bringing out a smooth water flow that sets the "feel" for the photo.  Since there''s so much symetry, perhaps crop out those elements which are not symetrical (top right).', '2004-12-29 16:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
