(1082261, 131357, 31244, '<td valign="top">A little noisy. Otherwise, very unique.</td>', 'A little noisy. Otherwise, very unique.', '2004-12-29 19:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082264, 131212, 31244, '<td valign="top">My favorite. 8.</td>', 'My favorite. 8.', '2004-12-29 19:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082276, 130726, 25397, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of mechanics some might overlook, good idea!<br/> <br/>The hands stand out good on the black backround to get your idea across but personally I think this may have looked better in black and white but I''m sure you got your reasons for keeping it color. :)</td>', 'This is a good example of mechanics some might overlook, good idea! The hands stand out good on the black backround to get your idea across but personally I think this may have looked better in black and white but I''m sure you got your reasons for keeping it color. :)', '2004-12-29 20:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082278, 130712, 25397, '<td valign="top">I like how you kept the bag of food, it makes the backround interesting!</td>', 'I like how you kept the bag of food, it makes the backround interesting!', '2004-12-29 20:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082280, 131152, 25397, '<td valign="top">Oh I think it''s a guitar... :-D<br/> <br/>Annd I see you in the reflection :)</td>', 'Oh I think it''s a guitar... :-D Annd I see you in the reflection :)', '2004-12-29 20:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082282, 131361, 25397, '<td valign="top">The different patchwork in the blanket behind is somewhat distracting to the nice piece you have there... Perhaps it would have worked better with a more vintage-feeling backround?</td>', 'The different patchwork in the blanket behind is somewhat distracting to the nice piece you have there... Perhaps it would have worked better with a more vintage-feeling backround?', '2004-12-29 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082284, 130101, 25397, '<td valign="top">I love how the leg breaks out of the border. The composition is also great, it''s like the ground is lighting up where the person steps. :)</td>', 'I love how the leg breaks out of the border. The composition is also great, it''s like the ground is lighting up where the person steps. :)', '2004-12-29 20:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082286, 130961, 25397, '<td valign="top">Aha! A perfect example of the theme! The dripping blood is perfect, looks real. I like the drip just being oozed out of the needle! And of course the frame is very effective.</td>', 'Aha! A perfect example of the theme! The dripping blood is perfect, looks real. I like the drip just being oozed out of the needle! And of course the frame is very effective.', '2004-12-29 20:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082287, 130240, 25397, '<td valign="top">Hmm a good shot but I tkink the mood would be better without that one spot of green left.</td>', 'Hmm a good shot but I tkink the mood would be better without that one spot of green left.', '2004-12-29 20:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082289, 131330, 25397, '<td valign="top">perfect title</td>', 'perfect title', '2004-12-29 20:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082291, 130963, 25397, '<td valign="top">I hope you get a ribbon for this, the angle is perfect and the whole idea is wonderful!</td>', 'I hope you get a ribbon for this, the angle is perfect and the whole idea is wonderful!', '2004-12-29 20:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082294, 131314, 25397, '<td valign="top">Aha, I really like the looks of this picture... The long backround makes the horse stand out. If you wanted to get rid of some of the noise on the horse you can use Neat Image- it''s free.</td>', 'Aha, I really like the looks of this picture... The long backround makes the horse stand out. If you wanted to get rid of some of the noise on the horse you can use Neat Image- it''s free.', '2004-12-29 20:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082301, 130569, 18194, '<td valign="top">For me the focus seems just a bit soft.</td>', 'For me the focus seems just a bit soft.', '2004-12-29 20:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082307, 130412, 18194, '<td valign="top">I would love to see what this looks like when the contrast is not so high.  At least for me I dont find the high contrast all the appealing, others might like it however.</td>', 'I would love to see what this looks like when the contrast is not so high.  At least for me I dont find the high contrast all the appealing, others might like it however.', '2004-12-29 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082309, 131318, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think this would have more impact if the focus was tack shape.</td>', 'I think this would have more impact if the focus was tack shape.', '2004-12-29 20:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082326, 131240, 30835, '<td valign="top">A really nice image, great texture and use of colour</td>', 'A really nice image, great texture and use of colour', '2004-12-29 21:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082327, 130995, 14202, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing, fous so crisp and you get to drink it after the shot is completed...Well done</td>', 'Perfect timing, fous so crisp and you get to drink it after the shot is completed...Well done', '2004-12-29 21:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082330, 131256, 30835, '<td valign="top">like your composition, the image is enhanced by the red berries, and redness of the metal</td>', 'like your composition, the image is enhanced by the red berries, and redness of the metal', '2004-12-29 21:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082335, 130691, 31213, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition.  Seems maybe a bit obvious with the photoshopping...little too yellow.  The front piece of wood is slightly blown out.  I love the bottle laying down and I love the slanted tear in the foil at the top of the bottle.  Great job!</td>', 'Awesome composition.  Seems maybe a bit obvious with the photoshopping...little too yellow.  The front piece of wood is slightly blown out.  I love the bottle laying down and I love the slanted tear in the foil at the top of the bottle.  Great job!', '2004-12-29 21:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082337, 131048, 30835, '<td valign="top">beautifully lit image</td>', 'beautifully lit image', '2004-12-29 21:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082342, 131224, 17047, '<td valign="top">Love the colours.</td>', 'Love the colours.', '2004-12-29 21:24:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1082344, 131357, 17047, '<td valign="top">Nice but the composition is a bit offputting and you seem to have cut the end off the pencil right at the top.</td>', 'Nice but the composition is a bit offputting and you seem to have cut the end off the pencil right at the top.', '2004-12-29 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082346, 130829, 17047, '<td valign="top">Too much extraneous matrial in the frame which makes the eye wander too much.  A more dynamic viewpoint would make the subject more interesting.</td>', 'Too much extraneous matrial in the frame which makes the eye wander too much.  A more dynamic viewpoint would make the subject more interesting.', '2004-12-29 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082351, 131191, 17047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and atmosphere</td>', 'Beautiful composition and atmosphere', '2004-12-29 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082352, 130628, 17047, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the use of negaitve space</td>', 'I like the tones and the use of negaitve space', '2004-12-29 21:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082353, 130917, 17047, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2004-12-29 21:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082358, 130456, 17047, '<td valign="top">The highliglights are way too overblown, they draw the eye and just won''t let go.</td>', 'The highliglights are way too overblown, they draw the eye and just won''t let go.', '2004-12-29 21:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082360, 130822, 26313, '<td valign="top">Even if it was in focus, I have to say, there are more interesting ways to photograph a pencil. Surely you could experiment with different angles, different lighting, etc?</td>', 'Even if it was in focus, I have to say, there are more interesting ways to photograph a pencil. Surely you could experiment with different angles, different lighting, etc?', '2004-12-29 21:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082361, 131349, 17047, '<td valign="top">Personally, I thik of it as more biological than mechanical.  Lighting is well done but to me it doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'Personally, I thik of it as more biological than mechanical.  Lighting is well done but to me it doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2004-12-29 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082363, 131016, 17047, '<td valign="top">Love it! 10!</td>', 'Love it! 10!', '2004-12-29 21:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082364, 131349, 26313, '<td valign="top">I think that''s really stretching the whole "Mechanical" idea...</td>', 'I think that''s really stretching the whole "Mechanical" idea...', '2004-12-29 21:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082365, 131228, 17047, '<td valign="top">Need a bit more lighting on the left side, it starts to fade away into the darkness and I keep finding my eye drawn away from the rest of the image into the dark.</td>', 'Need a bit more lighting on the left side, it starts to fade away into the darkness and I keep finding my eye drawn away from the rest of the image into the dark.', '2004-12-29 21:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082369, 131285, 17047, '<td valign="top">The flash loghting gives this a very harsh effect.</td>', 'The flash loghting gives this a very harsh effect.', '2004-12-29 21:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082371, 131317, 17047, '<td valign="top">I like it, though a little more detail in the corners would have been good.</td>', 'I like it, though a little more detail in the corners would have been good.', '2004-12-29 21:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082372, 130339, 30835, '<td valign="top">very nicely composed, good use of depth of field</td>', 'very nicely composed, good use of depth of field', '2004-12-29 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082373, 130895, 30983, '<td valign="top">That''s a rockin'' image. Extremely creative. My hat goes off to you sir.</td>', 'That''s a rockin'' image. Extremely creative. My hat goes off to you sir.', '2004-12-29 21:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082374, 131266, 17047, '<td valign="top">The composition works well, this would have looked great with a boost to the saturation to really seperate the main 2 tones.</td>', 'The composition works well, this would have looked great with a boost to the saturation to really seperate the main 2 tones.', '2004-12-29 21:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082377, 130660, 30983, '<td valign="top">That''s a great image, really nicely done.</td>', 'That''s a great image, really nicely done.', '2004-12-29 21:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082378, 130221, 30983, '<td valign="top">That''s an really great idea. A beautiful shot too.</td>', 'That''s an really great idea. A beautiful shot too.', '2004-12-29 21:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082380, 131173, 30983, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Great job.</td>', 'I love this shot. Great job.', '2004-12-29 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082381, 130216, 26313, '<td valign="top">Am I missing something? I''m a mechanical engineer--if there is something mechanical in this photo you''d hope I''d be able to pick it out... I don''t see it here, sorry...</td>', 'Am I missing something? I''m a mechanical engineer--if there is something mechanical in this photo you''d hope I''d be able to pick it out... I don''t see it here, sorry...', '2004-12-29 21:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082382, 130507, 30983, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. That''s really great.</td>', 'Excellent shot. That''s really great.', '2004-12-29 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082384, 131278, 14735, '<td valign="top">Perfect shutter speed for this shot</td>', 'Perfect shutter speed for this shot', '2004-12-29 21:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082386, 130813, 30983, '<td valign="top">Great concept. I really like this shot.</td>', 'Great concept. I really like this shot.', '2004-12-29 21:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082390, 130412, 30983, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is a truly excellent and moving image. Great job.</td>', 'Wow. This is a truly excellent and moving image. Great job.', '2004-12-29 21:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082395, 131279, 30835, '<td valign="top">a beautiful image, lovely lighting, colour and composition</td>', 'a beautiful image, lovely lighting, colour and composition', '2004-12-29 21:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082396, 131368, 30983, '<td valign="top">Truly excellent, This is a really moving shot.</td>', 'Truly excellent, This is a really moving shot.', '2004-12-29 21:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082397, 131361, 14735, '<td valign="top">I like the sewing machne but I didn''t care for the backround</td>', 'I like the sewing machne but I didn''t care for the backround', '2004-12-29 21:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082398, 130471, 30983, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting shot. Great job.</td>', 'This is a really interesting shot. Great job.', '2004-12-29 21:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082400, 130893, 20679, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this but not so sure about the border</td>', 'I love the lighting on this but not so sure about the border', '2004-12-29 21:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082401, 130899, 26313, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way this is lit at all--the bright snow and hedge in the foreground really distracts me from the hydrant.  Perhaps shooting from closer, and maybe a little lower, would have  given it a little more impact. Also, you could try a longer exposure with no flash (on a tripod), or maybe just a little less flash.</td>', 'I don''t like the way this is lit at all--the bright snow and hedge in the foreground really distracts me from the hydrant.  Perhaps shooting from closer, and maybe a little lower, would have  given it a little more impact. Also, you could try a longer exposure with no flash (on a tripod), or maybe just a little less flash.', '2004-12-29 21:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082404, 131268, 20679, '<td valign="top">black and white is effective here. I find the flare at the bottom of the photo a little distracting, and could probably have been burnt a little, as the advanced rules applied this time</td>', 'black and white is effective here. I find the flare at the bottom of the photo a little distracting, and could probably have been burnt a little, as the advanced rules applied this time', '2004-12-29 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082407, 130739, 26313, '<td valign="top">Seems rather out of focus to me. Mechanical doesn''t really jump to mind when I look at this.</td>', 'Seems rather out of focus to me. Mechanical doesn''t really jump to mind when I look at this.', '2004-12-29 21:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082408, 130899, 20679, '<td valign="top">wow...looks just like Santa but not sure of the relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'wow...looks just like Santa but not sure of the relevance to the challenge.', '2004-12-29 21:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082415, 131370, 26313, '<td valign="top">Well, great use of shallow depth of field, but there''s a dictionary shot like this in almost every challenge it seems (and I''m relatively new here).</td>', 'Well, great use of shallow depth of field, but there''s a dictionary shot like this in almost every challenge it seems (and I''m relatively new here).', '2004-12-29 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082420, 131291, 26313, '<td valign="top">It''s a unique and interesting angle on a fairly common concept for this challenge, but I don''t think it really emphasizes the mechanical nature of the bike very well. Even lighting it differently might help.</td>', 'It''s a unique and interesting angle on a fairly common concept for this challenge, but I don''t think it really emphasizes the mechanical nature of the bike very well. Even lighting it differently might help.', '2004-12-29 21:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082424, 131306, 26313, '<td valign="top">Could be a little sharper. I think it would be better either oriented vertically or placed off-center, and placing it further away from the wall or lighting it from a different angle would make the shadow an interesting feature rather than an annoying distraction.</td>', 'Could be a little sharper. I think it would be better either oriented vertically or placed off-center, and placing it further away from the wall or lighting it from a different angle would make the shadow an interesting feature rather than an annoying distraction.', '2004-12-29 22:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082426, 131191, 30835, '<td valign="top">a really pleasant image, quite evocative</td>', 'a really pleasant image, quite evocative', '2004-12-29 22:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082429, 130699, 26313, '<td valign="top">I actually really like this in a way, but plug wires are just about the most un-mechanical thing I can think of in an engine bay!</td>', 'I actually really like this in a way, but plug wires are just about the most un-mechanical thing I can think of in an engine bay!', '2004-12-29 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082430, 130608, 26313, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, and kinda small....</td>', 'Out of focus, and kinda small....', '2004-12-29 22:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082431, 131215, 31264, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, but I think the background doesn''t quite work, something simpler would''ve worked better for mechanical</td>', 'Nice effect, but I think the background doesn''t quite work, something simpler would''ve worked better for mechanical', '2004-12-29 22:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082432, 131274, 29513, '<td valign="top">I think I would prefer to see the colors here.  Nice framing.  It is so hard to decide what part of a large object to include.</td>', 'I think I would prefer to see the colors here.  Nice framing.  It is so hard to decide what part of a large object to include.', '2004-12-29 22:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082433, 130539, 26313, '<td valign="top">Nice work! This is one of my favourites in this challenge. Excellent focus, DOF, composition, and lighting.</td>', 'Nice work! This is one of my favourites in this challenge. Excellent focus, DOF, composition, and lighting.', '2004-12-29 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082434, 130995, 31264, '<td valign="top">Niclely done - squeezed the bottle propelling a loosely fitted cork combo out?  Definately a nice effect and one of the best so far!</td>', 'Niclely done - squeezed the bottle propelling a loosely fitted cork combo out?  Definately a nice effect and one of the best so far!', '2004-12-29 22:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082441, 130940, 29513, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how I would go about changing it but the lighting doen''t feel quite right.</td>', 'I''m not sure how I would go about changing it but the lighting doen''t feel quite right.', '2004-12-29 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082443, 131306, 29513, '<td valign="top">I might have tried a darker background.  Great shot otherwise.</td>', 'I might have tried a darker background.  Great shot otherwise.', '2004-12-29 22:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082447, 131260, 31157, '<td valign="top">I like the Log Cabin! The Sled is a nice idea too!</td>', 'I like the Log Cabin! The Sled is a nice idea too!', '2004-12-29 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082448, 131144, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow. it sure did die, didn''t it.</td>', 'wow. it sure did die, didn''t it.', '2004-12-29 22:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082452, 131266, 29513, '<td valign="top">This is the best I have seen so far, including mine.  I like the framing and the color and sharpness.  The old war horse put out to pasture.</td>', 'This is the best I have seen so far, including mine.  I like the framing and the color and sharpness.  The old war horse put out to pasture.', '2004-12-29 22:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082454, 131042, 25464, '<td valign="top">One of my top two 10.</td>', 'One of my top two 10.', '2004-12-29 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082455, 131349, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but you do an injustice in comparing this to a machine, in my humble opinion.</td>', 'Nice shot but you do an injustice in comparing this to a machine, in my humble opinion.', '2004-12-29 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082456, 130945, 25464, '<td valign="top">One of my top two.  I am not sure if this DOF choice will be well received, but I really like it this way.  Nice composition. 10.</td>', 'One of my top two.  I am not sure if this DOF choice will be well received, but I really like it this way.  Nice composition. 10.', '2004-12-29 22:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082458, 130711, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting, colorful, I like the DOF choice here. 9.</td>', 'Interesting, colorful, I like the DOF choice here. 9.', '2004-12-29 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082459, 130811, 25464, '<td valign="top">I am really not sure why this one appeals to me, but it does.  Nice details.</td>', 'I am really not sure why this one appeals to me, but it does.  Nice details.', '2004-12-29 22:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082460, 130964, 25464, '<td valign="top">The only thing I find a bit distracting here is the soft focus on the foreground objects.  The wrench looks great, and the color cast is perfect.</td>', 'The only thing I find a bit distracting here is the soft focus on the foreground objects.  The wrench looks great, and the color cast is perfect.', '2004-12-29 22:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082461, 130904, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the light in this one.  The slight color in the reflective surface is very nice.  I like the composition as well.</td>', 'I like the light in this one.  The slight color in the reflective surface is very nice.  I like the composition as well.', '2004-12-29 22:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082462, 130856, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and I will even ignore the electronics that are probably involved in moving that thing.  One gripe, the CSX colors might have looked pretty neat against the predominately grey/brown of the winter landscape.</td>', 'Nice shot and I will even ignore the electronics that are probably involved in moving that thing.  One gripe, the CSX colors might have looked pretty neat against the predominately grey/brown of the winter landscape.', '2004-12-29 22:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082463, 130917, 25464, '<td valign="top">This one will probably be marked down by some for the same reason I like it.  The light in this really enhances the subject.  Nice.</td>', 'This one will probably be marked down by some for the same reason I like it.  The light in this really enhances the subject.  Nice.', '2004-12-29 22:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
