(1082529, 131349, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very different intepretation of the category....but you''re right on!  I like the limited lighting and your use of shadows.  You aren''t showing too much but you are showing quite a bit about the human machine.</td>', 'Very different intepretation of the category....but you''re right on!  I like the limited lighting and your use of shadows.  You aren''t showing too much but you are showing quite a bit about the human machine.', '2004-12-29 23:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082533, 131255, 31214, '<td valign="top">Very impressive capture.  I like the way the stylus really contacts the record .  it almost looks like it''s digging in.  I''m not sure what those marks are going against the grain.  Is that the lighting or imperfections in the album?</td>', 'Very impressive capture.  I like the way the stylus really contacts the record .  it almost looks like it''s digging in.  I''m not sure what those marks are going against the grain.  Is that the lighting or imperfections in the album?', '2004-12-29 23:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082534, 131312, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great job!  Rule of Thirds all the way.  Very interesting to view.  I''m a little bothered by the 2nd staple.  It almost doesn''t look like it''s "in".</td>', 'Great job!  Rule of Thirds all the way.  Very interesting to view.  I''m a little bothered by the 2nd staple.  It almost doesn''t look like it''s "in".', '2004-12-29 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082586, 130262, 25464, '<td valign="top">I find this one interesting.  I like the composition, and the fact that you can see a fingerprint on one of the tuners.  I am a little turned off by the low light.  I think the lighting could have been a bit more dynamic.  Overall good work - 7.</td>', 'I find this one interesting.  I like the composition, and the fact that you can see a fingerprint on one of the tuners.  I am a little turned off by the low light.  I think the lighting could have been a bit more dynamic.  Overall good work - 7.', '2004-12-30 00:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082589, 130559, 25464, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice, and I like the "Old Fashioned" feel created by the shot.  I think the composition could have been more interesting with a different angle, or maybe less centered.  Overall good work. 7.</td>', 'Good subject choice, and I like the "Old Fashioned" feel created by the shot.  I think the composition could have been more interesting with a different angle, or maybe less centered.  Overall good work. 7.', '2004-12-30 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082590, 131283, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, kinda looks like a tractor sales calendar shot.  No big wow, but good. 7.</td>', 'This is a good shot, kinda looks like a tractor sales calendar shot.  No big wow, but good. 7.', '2004-12-30 00:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082591, 131353, 25464, '<td valign="top">Kinda gloomy no real wow for me, but technically sound and fits the challenge well. 6.</td>', 'Kinda gloomy no real wow for me, but technically sound and fits the challenge well. 6.', '2004-12-30 00:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082592, 131214, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the simple approach.  I think it fits this challenge well.  I am not sure the BW was the right choice for this shot, but I think it is good.  The spigot almost appears to be hanging in mid air. 7.</td>', 'I like the simple approach.  I think it fits this challenge well.  I am not sure the BW was the right choice for this shot, but I think it is good.  The spigot almost appears to be hanging in mid air. 7.', '2004-12-30 01:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082593, 130628, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, and the detail shown, but I am a little distracted by so much white space.  Just personal preference.  Well done. 7.</td>', 'I like the angle, and the detail shown, but I am a little distracted by so much white space.  Just personal preference.  Well done. 7.', '2004-12-30 01:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082595, 131145, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the rust and the detail.  The out of focus foreground is a little distracting, and the large white space in the upper right draws the eye out of the frame a bit.  I am also not real keen on the almost purple color.  That said, I do think this is an interesting subject choice and a good choice of angle.  OK shot - 6.</td>', 'I like the rust and the detail.  The out of focus foreground is a little distracting, and the large white space in the upper right draws the eye out of the frame a bit.  I am also not real keen on the almost purple color.  That said, I do think this is an interesting subject choice and a good choice of angle.  OK shot - 6.', '2004-12-30 01:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082596, 130474, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a very well taken product shot.  Looks like an advertisement.  It doesn''t wow me, but it is well done. 7.</td>', 'This is a very well taken product shot.  Looks like an advertisement.  It doesn''t wow me, but it is well done. 7.', '2004-12-30 01:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082597, 130989, 25464, '<td valign="top">I love the colors.  The subject and angle are interesting.  The soft focus in the foreground is a distraction to me.  Lighting is very nice.  Overall good work. 7.</td>', 'I love the colors.  The subject and angle are interesting.  The soft focus in the foreground is a distraction to me.  Lighting is very nice.  Overall good work. 7.', '2004-12-30 01:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082598, 131312, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very simplistic approach, which works well.  I am not opposed to the BW version, but I think in a mechanical challenge, it might have been better to leave this in the color version showing the chrome.  Just a thought.  Good job 7.</td>', 'Very simplistic approach, which works well.  I am not opposed to the BW version, but I think in a mechanical challenge, it might have been better to leave this in the color version showing the chrome.  Just a thought.  Good job 7.', '2004-12-30 01:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082600, 130856, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great angle.  Lighting is a little harsh. Good work. 6.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great angle.  Lighting is a little harsh. Good work. 6.', '2004-12-30 01:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082602, 131192, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  I think it would have been interesting to have the stamp standing up in an upper corner of the frame as if it were a distance away.  Focus is a little too soft on the handle for my taste here, but overall good job. 6.</td>', 'This is a great idea.  I think it would have been interesting to have the stamp standing up in an upper corner of the frame as if it were a distance away.  Focus is a little too soft on the handle for my taste here, but overall good job. 6.', '2004-12-30 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082604, 130716, 25464, '<td valign="top">I realize that the accordian is the subject here, but I think it is distracting to have the mans feet and lower legs out of the frame.  Kind of a strange downward angle.  Nice color and lighting. 6.</td>', 'I realize that the accordian is the subject here, but I think it is distracting to have the mans feet and lower legs out of the frame.  Kind of a strange downward angle.  Nice color and lighting. 6.', '2004-12-30 01:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
