(1082607, 131212, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this one would have been improved with a change in DOF.  If the veggies were in crisp focus as well, I think I would have liked this one better.  Good idea. 6.</td>', 'I think this one would have been improved with a change in DOF.  If the veggies were in crisp focus as well, I think I would have liked this one better.  Good idea. 6.', '2004-12-30 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
