(1082625, 131221, 23478, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, I wish I could say why!  Technically it is all together as far as focus, good DOF, interesting lighting and contrast.  The angle is also good.  There is something intangible that appeals also.  Great job.</td>', 'I really like this shot, I wish I could say why!  Technically it is all together as far as focus, good DOF, interesting lighting and contrast.  The angle is also good.  There is something intangible that appeals also.  Great job.', '2004-12-30 01:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
