(1082633, 130932, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is an "almost" shot.  I think it is on the verge of great.  The spools of thread are great, the angle is ok, the background is distracting and it needs a bit more even lighting.  But, the subject matter and composition are very good.  For the background, a white sheet would work great, since it is OOF because of the shallow DOF.</td>', 'This is an "almost" shot.  I think it is on the verge of great.  The spools of thread are great, the angle is ok, the background is distracting and it needs a bit more even lighting.  But, the subject matter and composition are very good.  For the background, a white sheet would work great, since it is OOF because of the shallow DOF.', '2004-12-30 02:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
