(1082670, 130885, 30861, '<td valign="top">an oddly confusing image. I''m not sure but what the monochrome is workign against you in this case...Love the juxtaposition of curves.</td>', 'an oddly confusing image. I''m not sure but what the monochrome is workign against you in this case...Love the juxtaposition of curves.', '2004-12-30 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082672, 131298, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like the palpable lighting, soft and sharp at same time. I don''t carte for the muddy hint of overall green in the color.</td>', 'I like the palpable lighting, soft and sharp at same time. I don''t carte for the muddy hint of overall green in the color.', '2004-12-30 02:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082673, 131359, 30861, '<td valign="top">Dramatic as hell. Might work better if the subject were up and left 10% each, so the key diagonal line fell parallele to but slightly above the corner-to-corner diagonal. I wish the lighting gave me a hair of separation from shadowed area of object to pure black background. Just a hair, not much...</td>', 'Dramatic as hell. Might work better if the subject were up and left 10% each, so the key diagonal line fell parallele to but slightly above the corner-to-corner diagonal. I wish the lighting gave me a hair of separation from shadowed area of object to pure black background. Just a hair, not much...', '2004-12-30 02:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082677, 131042, 30861, '<td valign="top">I donno, this is skilfullyh enough done but it seems so pat to me. Also, the way the shadows fall on the white make it too obviosu that this is a rotated, horizontal composition, and it seems arbitrary/artificial to me.</td>', 'I donno, this is skilfullyh enough done but it seems so pat to me. Also, the way the shadows fall on the white make it too obviosu that this is a rotated, horizontal composition, and it seems arbitrary/artificial to me.', '2004-12-30 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082678, 130539, 30861, '<td valign="top">almost there. Watch could be rotated clockwise maybe 15-20 degrees. Lighting a little blocked up, losing shadow detail in subject. exactly half the image is the antique diagram, so it''s sort of static. The rotation of the watch woudl have helped this. These sorts of shots are devilishly difficult to light.</td>', 'almost there. Watch could be rotated clockwise maybe 15-20 degrees. Lighting a little blocked up, losing shadow detail in subject. exactly half the image is the antique diagram, so it''s sort of static. The rotation of the watch woudl have helped this. These sorts of shots are devilishly difficult to light.', '2004-12-30 02:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082679, 130559, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish like hell the "horizon line" weren''t parallel to and  and tangent to the lowermost of the wires on the rearmost whisk (if that makes sense?). An overall sense of muddiness detracts a bit, even recofnizing the desire to "antique" this through sepia tonalities. One thing I notice is that the beater shows to best advantage in its reflection, not its actuality; a pity this isn''t reversed...</td>', 'I wish like hell the "horizon line" weren''t parallel to and  and tangent to the lowermost of the wires on the rearmost whisk (if that makes sense?). An overall sense of muddiness detracts a bit, even recofnizing the desire to "antique" this through sepia tonalities. One thing I notice is that the beater shows to best advantage in its reflection, not its actuality; a pity this isn''t reversed...', '2004-12-30 02:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082681, 131273, 30861, '<td valign="top">Awkward focus, poor white balance, fairkly arbitrary composition, all work against this.</td>', 'Awkward focus, poor white balance, fairkly arbitrary composition, all work against this.', '2004-12-30 02:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082682, 131168, 30861, '<td valign="top">sweet image. a lot to like. I wonder isa the backgroudn a hair too bright?</td>', 'sweet image. a lot to like. I wonder isa the backgroudn a hair too bright?', '2004-12-30 02:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082683, 131278, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish to hell this were squared up vertically and horizontally; it only wants a smidgeon of rotation to accomplish. the motion is very very nice, as is the framing. Was the pure black groudn your best choice?</td>', 'I wish to hell this were squared up vertically and horizontally; it only wants a smidgeon of rotation to accomplish. the motion is very very nice, as is the framing. Was the pure black groudn your best choice?', '2004-12-30 02:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082684, 130628, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and texture, way too much negative white space IMO</td>', 'Lovely detail and texture, way too much negative white space IMO', '2004-12-30 03:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082685, 131048, 30861, '<td valign="top">Sweet, but I''m not sure I wouldn''t prefer it with no blur; that aspect seems not to be working for me, in this case. Not sure why...</td>', 'Sweet, but I''m not sure I wouldn''t prefer it with no blur; that aspect seems not to be working for me, in this case. Not sure why...', '2004-12-30 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082686, 130610, 30861, '<td valign="top">Just too chaotic, too harsh and blocked up</td>', 'Just too chaotic, too harsh and blocked up', '2004-12-30 03:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082688, 131221, 30861, '<td valign="top">Compositionally and conceptually I liek this a lot. It seems to me, however, that you''ve created a disconnect from right to left with the agressive background color shift.</td>', 'Compositionally and conceptually I liek this a lot. It seems to me, however, that you''ve created a disconnect from right to left with the agressive background color shift.', '2004-12-30 03:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082689, 130460, 30861, '<td valign="top">needs sharpness and white balance work, to my eye.N icely composed, though.</td>', 'needs sharpness and white balance work, to my eye.N icely composed, though.', '2004-12-30 03:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082690, 131327, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very appealing colors, but I can''t pull  any sense of order out of this chaos; what am i suppsoed to be looking AT?</td>', 'Very appealing colors, but I can''t pull  any sense of order out of this chaos; what am i suppsoed to be looking AT?', '2004-12-30 03:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082691, 131256, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love the IDEA of a Swiss Roll in this challenge. This one''s pretty tight &amp; clean, if a bit overshopped especially in the red saturation.</td>', 'I love the IDEA of a Swiss Roll in this challenge. This one''s pretty tight & clean, if a bit overshopped especially in the red saturation.', '2004-12-30 03:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082692, 130372, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish it had more of a subject/ground dichotomy, the image is not resolving itself visually I think.</td>', 'I wish it had more of a subject/ground dichotomy, the image is not resolving itself visually I think.', '2004-12-30 03:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082693, 131152, 30861, '<td valign="top">very tich tonalities and lighting. The cropping is cojunter-intuitive to me; that tab on the right doesn''t contribute much, the machinery on the left is too truncated. I''d liek to see the rear key rotated a tad so it picks up a little more light.</td>', 'very tich tonalities and lighting. The cropping is cojunter-intuitive to me; that tab on the right doesn''t contribute much, the machinery on the left is too truncated. I''d liek to see the rear key rotated a tad so it picks up a little more light.', '2004-12-30 03:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082695, 130258, 30861, '<td valign="top">I was surprised to see so few hand cutting tools. This is quite appealing, but the tight foreground cropping is unfortunate. you have plenty of extra space up top, doing nothing much.</td>', 'I was surprised to see so few hand cutting tools. This is quite appealing, but the tight foreground cropping is unfortunate. you have plenty of extra space up top, doing nothing much.', '2004-12-30 03:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082696, 131330, 30861, '<td valign="top">powerful composition, harsh and unforgiving. I don''t LIKE it that much, but when I look at it I can''t isolate why, and then I start toi like it again... Strange.</td>', 'powerful composition, harsh and unforgiving. I don''t LIKE it that much, but when I look at it I can''t isolate why, and then I start toi like it again... Strange.', '2004-12-30 03:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082697, 130569, 30861, '<td valign="top">This works way better as thumbnail, where it''s quite striking. Suffers only from lack of sharpness on chain, anmd a little blocking of the dark areas.</td>', 'This works way better as thumbnail, where it''s quite striking. Suffers only from lack of sharpness on chain, anmd a little blocking of the dark areas.', '2004-12-30 03:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082698, 130995, 19959, '<td valign="top">I was going to enter a bottle opener, couldn''t get a shot I liked though. If I had managed this I would have been delighted!. Excellent. Top 3 IMO</td>', 'I was going to enter a bottle opener, couldn''t get a shot I liked though. If I had managed this I would have been delighted!. Excellent. Top 3 IMO', '2004-12-30 03:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082719, 130216, 24778, '<td valign="top">I wonder what is mechanical in here? really... don''t think you fit the challenge at all... and I think I''m not the only one...</td>', 'I wonder what is mechanical in here? really... don''t think you fit the challenge at all... and I think I''m not the only one...', '2004-12-30 04:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082732, 131290, 29513, '<td valign="top">Maybe frame it a little looser to include the mechanism that is supporting it.  I don''t think I have seen one built like this before.  I like the path worn in the snow and it might be good to see the whole loop.</td>', 'Maybe frame it a little looser to include the mechanism that is supporting it.  I don''t think I have seen one built like this before.  I like the path worn in the snow and it might be good to see the whole loop.', '2004-12-30 05:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082734, 130822, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the color combination.  The pencil could be sharper, though.</td>', 'I like the color combination.  The pencil could be sharper, though.', '2004-12-30 05:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082735, 131243, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice try at the "dark subject on snow" shot.  Sort of like a 7-10 split in bowling.  I usually try to pick one or the other and let the other fall where it may.  There seems to be a loss of detail on both here.</td>', 'Nice try at the "dark subject on snow" shot.  Sort of like a 7-10 split in bowling.  I usually try to pick one or the other and let the other fall where it may.  There seems to be a loss of detail on both here.', '2004-12-30 05:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082736, 130885, 30468, '<td valign="top">Very good light and contrast</td>', 'Very good light and contrast', '2004-12-30 05:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082737, 131274, 27845, '<td valign="top">The perspective is  abit confusing, the many lines don''t go well with the cast shadows. I''d have preferred  straight up shot. 6.</td>', 'The perspective is  abit confusing, the many lines don''t go well with the cast shadows. I''d have preferred  straight up shot. 6.', '2004-12-30 06:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082738, 131253, 27845, '<td valign="top">A nice mechanism. I like the shiny golden surface. I think you should have chosen a brighter background, the blue part doesn''t come out good enough against it. I''d probably have chosen a much tighter crop without any of the background, just the gears showing. 7.</td>', 'A nice mechanism. I like the shiny golden surface. I think you should have chosen a brighter background, the blue part doesn''t come out good enough against it. I''d probably have chosen a much tighter crop without any of the background, just the gears showing. 7.', '2004-12-30 06:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082739, 130682, 27845, '<td valign="top">A bit too shallow in the background, I''d have liked a larger DOF. Nice macro, I like the many details and the dirt. Fits the challenge very well. It would have done better as b&amp;w though. 6.</td>', 'A bit too shallow in the background, I''d have liked a larger DOF. Nice macro, I like the many details and the dirt. Fits the challenge very well. It would have done better as b&w though. 6.', '2004-12-30 06:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082740, 131314, 31213, '<td valign="top">I like how the spring almost lights up and the background is intersting and yet not distracting.  Very nice.  My only recomendation is that you brighten the horse a little to make it stand out a little more.  Nice job</td>', 'I like how the spring almost lights up and the background is intersting and yet not distracting.  Very nice.  My only recomendation is that you brighten the horse a little to make it stand out a little more.  Nice job', '2004-12-30 06:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082741, 131215, 27845, '<td valign="top">This oicture looks really cool. I forgive you the ratzher weak link to the challenge :)<br/>I like the movement, how did you get it like that? Did you use a flash and set a long exposure?<br/>The colous in the background a appealing, not too contrasting, the fabric really adds a nice aspect to the metallic mobile. 8.</td>', 'This oicture looks really cool. I forgive you the ratzher weak link to the challenge :)I like the movement, how did you get it like that? Did you use a flash and set a long exposure?The colous in the background a appealing, not too contrasting, the fabric really adds a nice aspect to the metallic mobile. 8.', '2004-12-30 06:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082742, 130318, 31213, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Its a little hard to tell where exactly your focal point is.  The ridges are in the crash points but neither stands out as the obvious focal point.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Its a little hard to tell where exactly your focal point is.  The ridges are in the crash points but neither stands out as the obvious focal point.', '2004-12-30 06:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082743, 130813, 27845, '<td valign="top">You should have shown the corkscrew in action, it would have been more interesting. The picture looks to flat, there''s nothing really interesting in it. You had a good idea with setting the cork and the screw up in a way that one''s protecting the other, but it doesn''t add to the challenge theme. 3.</td>', 'You should have shown the corkscrew in action, it would have been more interesting. The picture looks to flat, there''s nothing really interesting in it. You had a good idea with setting the cork and the screw up in a way that one''s protecting the other, but it doesn''t add to the challenge theme. 3.', '2004-12-30 06:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082744, 131201, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  I like the vast whiteness on the right side of the photo.  It adds so much drama to the picture!</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  I like the vast whiteness on the right side of the photo.  It adds so much drama to the picture!', '2004-12-30 06:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082745, 131258, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the contarst in this picture. I''d have preferred a different point of view, showing more of the wheel or of the gears. It was a good idea to have someone sitting on the bike! 6.</td>', 'I like the contarst in this picture. I''d have preferred a different point of view, showing more of the wheel or of the gears. It was a good idea to have someone sitting on the bike! 6.', '2004-12-30 06:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082746, 130843, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  I like how there is nothing else distracting in the photo.  The scissors are also not centered and use the rule of thirds very nicely.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  I like how there is nothing else distracting in the photo.  The scissors are also not centered and use the rule of thirds very nicely.  Great job!', '2004-12-30 06:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082748, 131358, 27845, '<td valign="top">Uh, what is this? I can''t imagine what this belongs to. But it looks mechanical enough to me.<br/>You have quite a large empty area at the top of your picture. You might have just cropped it away as it doesn''t contain any interesting elements.<br/>I like the detail on the lever, it has got a nice texture. 5.</td>', 'Uh, what is this? I can''t imagine what this belongs to. But it looks mechanical enough to me.You have quite a large empty area at the top of your picture. You might have just cropped it away as it doesn''t contain any interesting elements.I like the detail on the lever, it has got a nice texture. 5.', '2004-12-30 06:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082749, 131266, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool. This looks really mechanic. The colours are just right, there''s some orange rust which goes well with the many shades of black. I like the detail you got into it. The crop is interesting, the wheel looks dynamic, the off-center composition adds a lot to the picture. 10.</td>', 'Cool. This looks really mechanic. The colours are just right, there''s some orange rust which goes well with the many shades of black. I like the detail you got into it. The crop is interesting, the wheel looks dynamic, the off-center composition adds a lot to the picture. 10.', '2004-12-30 06:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082753, 131267, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool, how did you get an X-ray shot of this? There are no X-ray filters for cams, are there? I guess you work at an airport or something. I don''t know what a baitcaster is but it looks cool.. The colours are kinda psychedelcic, but I like the orange blue-contrast. There''s just too much ''empty'' spae around the two (?) objects. 7.</td>', 'Cool, how did you get an X-ray shot of this? There are no X-ray filters for cams, are there? I guess you work at an airport or something. I don''t know what a baitcaster is but it looks cool.. The colours are kinda psychedelcic, but I like the orange blue-contrast. There''s just too much ''empty'' spae around the two (?) objects. 7.', '2004-12-30 06:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082754, 131328, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice title, but I see just the clock, not the clockwork. It doesn''t really meet the challenge. 3.</td>', 'Nice title, but I see just the clock, not the clockwork. It doesn''t really meet the challenge. 3.', '2004-12-30 06:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082755, 131185, 27845, '<td valign="top">he picture is too dark, there''s not enough detail in the black surface. I know that''s the way the camera is. You might have concentrated on the adjustment wheels and the shutter. 5.</td>', 'he picture is too dark, there''s not enough detail in the black surface. I know that''s the way the camera is. You might have concentrated on the adjustment wheels and the shutter. 5.', '2004-12-30 06:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082757, 130262, 27845, '<td valign="top">Is that a guitar? I never thought of it as being mechanical. Cool.</td>', 'Is that a guitar? I never thought of it as being mechanical. Cool.', '2004-12-30 06:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082773, 130822, 19959, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, but the focus appears off.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, but the focus appears off.', '2004-12-30 07:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082774, 130794, 14614, '<td valign="top">I know the background is tough to shoot around but it detracts from your marvelous mechanical item (you''ve really captured the detail but it''s lost amongst the cabinets and cooktop)</td>', 'I know the background is tough to shoot around but it detracts from your marvelous mechanical item (you''ve really captured the detail but it''s lost amongst the cabinets and cooktop)', '2004-12-30 07:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082776, 130986, 14614, '<td valign="top">high key effect makes this interesting, good job with the border as it finishes off the shot</td>', 'high key effect makes this interesting, good job with the border as it finishes off the shot', '2004-12-30 07:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082788, 131191, 19959, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Should do very well...</td>', 'Excellent. Should do very well...', '2004-12-30 08:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082790, 131048, 19959, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition and exposure. The motion blur is spot on. Top 3 IMO</td>', 'Perfect composition and exposure. The motion blur is spot on. Top 3 IMO', '2004-12-30 08:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082791, 131016, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is great, I hope it does well.</td>', 'This is great, I hope it does well.', '2004-12-30 08:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082792, 130501, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2004-12-30 08:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082793, 131364, 19959, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2004-12-30 08:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082828, 130898, 29440, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best picture in the challenge.  I hope it gets its reward by earning a ribbon.  The only draw back is the younger generation not knowing what it is. I remember the Victor Labels and the dog they used as their trademark.  There definitely is nothing electrical/electronic associated with your picture.<br/> <br/>Hope all goes well</td>', 'I think this is the best picture in the challenge.  I hope it gets its reward by earning a ribbon.  The only draw back is the younger generation not knowing what it is. I remember the Victor Labels and the dog they used as their trademark.  There definitely is nothing electrical/electronic associated with your picture. Hope all goes well', '2004-12-30 09:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
