(1082844, 131194, 28610, '<td valign="top">It''s a crank shaft, and cam shaft for what engine, I don''t know  Possibly a Briggs &amp; Stratton IC 12 hp</td>', 'It''s a crank shaft, and cam shaft for what engine, I don''t know  Possibly a Briggs & Stratton IC 12 hp', '2004-12-30 09:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
