(1082877, 130539, 14603, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean and with good composition...one of the better watch shots so far.</td>', 'Crisp, clean and with good composition...one of the better watch shots so far.', '2004-12-30 10:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082918, 130728, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and presented.</td>', 'Nicely exposed and presented.', '2004-12-30 11:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082925, 130811, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting,shallow DOF and composition used for this image.<br/>The light dusting of snow adds to it`s impact also.<br/>Nice work...hope it does well.</td>', 'I like the lighting,shallow DOF and composition used for this image.The light dusting of snow adds to it`s impact also.Nice work...hope it does well.', '2004-12-30 11:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082928, 130335, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used the light to emphasise the shape of the vice.<br/>Perhaps if the jaws had been visible showing the grip pattern..it may have added extra impact.<br/>Good image just the same.</td>', 'I like the way you have used the light to emphasise the shape of the vice.Perhaps if the jaws had been visible showing the grip pattern..it may have added extra impact.Good image just the same.', '2004-12-30 11:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082930, 131361, 14603, '<td valign="top">Brings back memories...my mother had an identically designed sewing machine made by Singer".</td>', 'Brings back memories...my mother had an identically designed sewing machine made by Singer".', '2004-12-30 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082932, 130262, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and lit..also suits the tonal treatment.</td>', 'Nicely composed and lit..also suits the tonal treatment.', '2004-12-30 11:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082933, 131214, 8139, '<td valign="top">Simplicity = effectiveness.</td>', 'Simplicity = effectiveness.', '2004-12-30 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082937, 130893, 29799, '<td valign="top">This is really good. The lighting is excellent! Well done.</td>', 'This is really good. The lighting is excellent! Well done.', '2004-12-30 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082940, 131255, 29799, '<td valign="top">I love this picture, but the contest is for something mechanical that doesn''t use electricity and a record player does use electricity. However, great pic!</td>', 'I love this picture, but the contest is for something mechanical that doesn''t use electricity and a record player does use electricity. However, great pic!', '2004-12-30 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082942, 131327, 29799, '<td valign="top">I almost did my "apple peeler, corer, slicer" in this challenge as well! High marks for great lighting and shadows!</td>', 'I almost did my "apple peeler, corer, slicer" in this challenge as well! High marks for great lighting and shadows!', '2004-12-30 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082943, 131349, 30861, '<td valign="top">I am sure there are going to be howls that there is nothing "mechanical" about this image. I am sure the photographer has reasoned backwards and decided that the entire process of creating life is fundamentally mechanical; that''s what his title implies. It''s an interesting position to take, although I''d argue that "biological processes" may result in "mechanical" objects, but the process is still biological. Regardless, I appreciate the out-of-the-bix thinking here; sheer chutzpah.<br/> <br/>As for the image itself? It''s nice, but nothing special, pretty standard backlit-pregnant-woman shot.</td>', 'I am sure there are going to be howls that there is nothing "mechanical" about this image. I am sure the photographer has reasoned backwards and decided that the entire process of creating life is fundamentally mechanical; that''s what his title implies. It''s an interesting position to take, although I''d argue that "biological processes" may result in "mechanical" objects, but the process is still biological. Regardless, I appreciate the out-of-the-bix thinking here; sheer chutzpah. As for the image itself? It''s nice, but nothing special, pretty standard backlit-pregnant-woman shot.', '2004-12-30 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082944, 131317, 29799, '<td valign="top">I would have given this pic a 9 if you had cropped the lacy stuff off the bottom to show JUST the mechanical item. Love the contrasting light and dark though.</td>', 'I would have given this pic a 9 if you had cropped the lacy stuff off the bottom to show JUST the mechanical item. Love the contrasting light and dark though.', '2004-12-30 11:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082946, 131120, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is clean work, but nothing sets it apart really. one thing, incidentally, that''s totally wrong is the use of dried, commercial pasta as a prop. The tomato, while making for a lovely reflection, is exceeding arbitrary also. If you''d shot this with ribbons of fresh pasta, I''d have bumped it up a point. Alaso, cropping is too tight all sides but right, IMO.</td>', 'This is clean work, but nothing sets it apart really. one thing, incidentally, that''s totally wrong is the use of dried, commercial pasta as a prop. The tomato, while making for a lovely reflection, is exceeding arbitrary also. If you''d shot this with ribbons of fresh pasta, I''d have bumped it up a point. Alaso, cropping is too tight all sides but right, IMO.', '2004-12-30 11:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082948, 131280, 30468, '<td valign="top">Very, Very Good!!</td>', 'Very, Very Good!!', '2004-12-30 11:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1082951, 131016, 29799, '<td valign="top">you lose votes for the scary clown! (Just kidding) Well done</td>', 'you lose votes for the scary clown! (Just kidding) Well done', '2004-12-30 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1);
