(1083089, 131120, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like this shot. The colors work well, I like the burst of red from the tomato, and the yellows from the pasta and handle, and the white sprinkling of flour is a very nice touch. Lighting is pretty good, but perhaps a fill light or reflector could eliminate the shadow on the noodles? Also, I think if the tomato were just a tad bit higher(towards the top left corner) so the handle arm did not go across it, it might be a slight improvement. Good job.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like this shot. The colors work well, I like the burst of red from the tomato, and the yellows from the pasta and handle, and the white sprinkling of flour is a very nice touch. Lighting is pretty good, but perhaps a fill light or reflector could eliminate the shadow on the noodles? Also, I think if the tomato were just a tad bit higher(towards the top left corner) so the handle arm did not go across it, it might be a slight improvement. Good job.', '2004-12-30 14:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
