(1083375, 130335, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good detail. Looks like good lighting, and I like the darkness/shadows, but I think just a little too much. Maybe a little bit more of the vise in light would improve the shot.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good detail. Looks like good lighting, and I like the darkness/shadows, but I think just a little too much. Maybe a little bit more of the vise in light would improve the shot.', '2004-12-30 18:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
