(1083785, 130813, 30861, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t have anything going for it other than a "mechanical device"; the composition is awkward, the background comes across muddy, I donno... Be nicer maybe if the corkscrew ere protruding a but through the bottom ring. Maybe witht he cork still appended to it? It''s just static to my eye.</td>', 'This just doesn''t have anything going for it other than a "mechanical device"; the composition is awkward, the background comes across muddy, I donno... Be nicer maybe if the corkscrew ere protruding a but through the bottom ring. Maybe witht he cork still appended to it? It''s just static to my eye.', '2004-12-30 23:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083786, 131318, 30861, '<td valign="top">The framing on this makes no sense to me, all that empty space doing nothing dynamic or informational... The crop onto the handles hurts. the light seems unflattering. The background feels muddy.</td>', 'The framing on this makes no sense to me, all that empty space doing nothing dynamic or informational... The crop onto the handles hurts. the light seems unflattering. The background feels muddy.', '2004-12-30 23:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083787, 131280, 29148, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. An 8</td>', 'Neat idea. An 8', '2004-12-30 23:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083788, 131016, 30861, '<td valign="top">I want to like this a lot more than I do. I probably would if the crank were an integrated, effective part of the composition. After all, the crank is what would most shout "mechanical", no? I like the border on this one, rare for me.</td>', 'I want to like this a lot more than I do. I probably would if the crank were an integrated, effective part of the composition. After all, the crank is what would most shout "mechanical", no? I like the border on this one, rare for me.', '2004-12-30 23:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083789, 131278, 17047, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of movement, maybe even a longer shutter speed to get the arm swinging across the whole face of the metronome would have added even more interest. The lighting is farily bland and it could have been cropped more tightly to reduce some of the background which doesn''t add anything to the image.</td>', 'I like the sense of movement, maybe even a longer shutter speed to get the arm swinging across the whole face of the metronome would have added even more interest. The lighting is farily bland and it could have been cropped more tightly to reduce some of the background which doesn''t add anything to the image.', '2004-12-30 23:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083791, 131299, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a strong, even brutalist view of the tool, but its potential is betrayed by the lighting and the framing. The defined vertical of the bit thru the handle would be better placed another 15-20% to the right, I think. And the lighting could be worked with to make it sing a lot more.</td>', 'It''s a strong, even brutalist view of the tool, but its potential is betrayed by the lighting and the framing. The defined vertical of the bit thru the handle would be better placed another 15-20% to the right, I think. And the lighting could be worked with to make it sing a lot more.', '2004-12-30 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083792, 130707, 17047, '<td valign="top">Lovely movement and colour</td>', 'Lovely movement and colour', '2004-12-30 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083793, 131357, 29148, '<td valign="top">I like your composition. Something seems to be lacking, but I don''t know what. A 6</td>', 'I like your composition. Something seems to be lacking, but I don''t know what. A 6', '2004-12-30 23:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083794, 131357, 30861, '<td valign="top">ann oddlu appealing image of the pencil itself, but hurt by the very odd framing of the object.</td>', 'ann oddlu appealing image of the pencil itself, but hurt by the very odd framing of the object.', '2004-12-30 23:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083796, 131326, 17047, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it seems to be quite out of focus</td>', 'Unfortunately it seems to be quite out of focus', '2004-12-30 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083797, 131364, 17047, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.<br/> <br/>Great tones and the dark sepia really adds to the old feel of the image. Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Great tones and the dark sepia really adds to the old feel of the image. Quite beautiful.', '2004-12-30 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083798, 131254, 30861, '<td valign="top">I feel like this same shot could have been adjusted to be much more effective; there''s alot of potential here. I wish the base were truly squared up, it''s slightly lopsided and that bugs me. The purity and aggresiveness of the overall red background seems to be working <i>against</i> the motion you''re trying to depict.</td>', 'I feel like this same shot could have been adjusted to be much more effective; there''s alot of potential here. I wish the base were truly squared up, it''s slightly lopsided and that bugs me. The purity and aggresiveness of the overall red background seems to be working against the motion you''re trying to depict.', '2004-12-30 23:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083799, 130628, 17507, '<td valign="top">great cropping. adds a lot of interest to this photo. the angle of the light is good too- i like the shadows on the gear in the LR.</td>', 'great cropping. adds a lot of interest to this photo. the angle of the light is good too- i like the shadows on the gear in the LR.', '2004-12-30 23:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083801, 131312, 17047, '<td valign="top">I like this! Simple but very effective.</td>', 'I like this! Simple but very effective.', '2004-12-30 23:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083804, 131291, 17047, '<td valign="top">Effective composition but there''s something weird going on here. Camera shake? tonal clipping? Something''s not quite right.</td>', 'Effective composition but there''s something weird going on here. Camera shake? tonal clipping? Something''s not quite right.', '2004-12-30 23:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083805, 130986, 17047, '<td valign="top">The high ket effect really suits this image. Nice :)</td>', 'The high ket effect really suits this image. Nice :)', '2004-12-30 23:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
