(1083808, 130822, 17047, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this is pretty bad - out of focus, compositionally awkward, blown highlights. Seems like you''ve gone a bit closer to the pen than your lens will allow. Try turning the pen a little so it''s coming towards the viewer and pick a point of it to focus on.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this is pretty bad - out of focus, compositionally awkward, blown highlights. Seems like you''ve gone a bit closer to the pen than your lens will allow. Try turning the pen a little so it''s coming towards the viewer and pick a point of it to focus on.', '2004-12-30 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
