(1083829, 131280, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: 5, Maybe if you try at some unusual angle it would spark more interest for the viewer.<br/>Technical: 4, A bit blurry and full of specks that degrade the overall effect.<br/>Appeal: 5<br/>Challenge: 9<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6, This is just a difficult subject to get very interesting.</td>', 'Composition: 5, Maybe if you try at some unusual angle it would spark more interest for the viewer.Technical: 4, A bit blurry and full of specks that degrade the overall effect.Appeal: 5Challenge: 9Overall Calculated Average Score: 6, This is just a difficult subject to get very interesting.', '2004-12-30 23:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083831, 130812, 30861, '<td valign="top">I admire this one for alternative thinking. I wish the back part of the hinge were lightened a stop or so.</td>', 'I admire this one for alternative thinking. I wish the back part of the hinge were lightened a stop or so.', '2004-12-30 23:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083834, 131287, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful object but the lighting and background don''t begin to do it justice. As a sidenote, how is a tpewriter the <br/>grandfather" of a computer? Wouldn''t that be an adding machine? Or better yet, an abacus?</td>', 'It''s a wonderful object but the lighting and background don''t begin to do it justice. As a sidenote, how is a tpewriter the grandfather" of a computer? Wouldn''t that be an adding machine? Or better yet, an abacus?', '2004-12-30 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1083836, 130797, 30861, '<td valign="top">Helluva mechanical, yup. The extreme blue sky''s workign against you here. I''d love to see this with sunset light.</td>', 'Helluva mechanical, yup. The extreme blue sky''s workign against you here. I''d love to see this with sunset light.', '2004-12-30 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
