(1083852, 130221, 10658, '<td valign="top">The subject is interesting, but the photo isn''t crisp enough for me.  The black in the corners (round table?) is distracting too.  I like the shadows of the paperclips, but this definitely needs better cropping.  Lighting is kinda odd too, but to create the shadows I can sort of understand how the bottom left hand corner could get overexposed.  Anyway, it meets the challenge and it''s a good try so I''m going with a 5.</td>', 'The subject is interesting, but the photo isn''t crisp enough for me.  The black in the corners (round table?) is distracting too.  I like the shadows of the paperclips, but this definitely needs better cropping.  Lighting is kinda odd too, but to create the shadows I can sort of understand how the bottom left hand corner could get overexposed.  Anyway, it meets the challenge and it''s a good try so I''m going with a 5.', '2004-12-30 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
