(1084327, 130460, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice. One of the few shots which shows the mechanics of a clock without opening it. I had to tell other who sent in a watch or clock that I don''t like the way they want the viewer to anticipate the mechanics inside. You did a good job showing the pendulum in movement. 7.</td>', 'Nice. One of the few shots which shows the mechanics of a clock without opening it. I had to tell other who sent in a watch or clock that I don''t like the way they want the viewer to anticipate the mechanics inside. You did a good job showing the pendulum in movement. 7.', '2004-12-31 12:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084330, 131221, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and lovely colours. Look really old and rusty. We might compare our entries after the challenge. I''ll PM you. 8.</td>', 'Nice detail and lovely colours. Look really old and rusty. We might compare our entries after the challenge. I''ll PM you. 8.', '2004-12-31 12:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084353, 130462, 31214, '<td valign="top">Spectacular shot.  I love the motion you''ve captured....and the lighting coimg from the center and along the spokes is slendid.  Even the shadows are neat to look at.  Well done!</td>', 'Spectacular shot.  I love the motion you''ve captured....and the lighting coimg from the center and along the spokes is slendid.  Even the shadows are neat to look at.  Well done!', '2004-12-31 12:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084357, 131152, 31214, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Clarity is great.  The only recommendation I have is to change the background....it''s slightly distracting.  Very good work!</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Clarity is great.  The only recommendation I have is to change the background....it''s slightly distracting.  Very good work!', '2004-12-31 12:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084360, 131041, 31214, '<td valign="top">I just like this photo.  I love the way you''ve cropped it.  Perhaps a more diffused light source to hide the hot spots.  Good job!</td>', 'I just like this photo.  I love the way you''ve cropped it.  Perhaps a more diffused light source to hide the hot spots.  Good job!', '2004-12-31 12:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084363, 130952, 31214, '<td valign="top">I smile when I look at this one.  Love the colors and the set-up of the picture.  Looks life-size to me.  I also like the way you''ve positioned the loose nuts and bolts...they seem to flow toward the dummy''s feet where they are "integrated" into his own ankles.  Funny that I assume that it''s a male......guess we don''t know!  Great job and thanks for the opportunity to view this.</td>', 'I smile when I look at this one.  Love the colors and the set-up of the picture.  Looks life-size to me.  I also like the way you''ve positioned the loose nuts and bolts...they seem to flow toward the dummy''s feet where they are "integrated" into his own ankles.  Funny that I assume that it''s a male......guess we don''t know!  Great job and thanks for the opportunity to view this.', '2004-12-31 12:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084366, 130885, 31214, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo!  The lighting is so interesting...combined with the B&amp;W.  You''ve made the apple look almost artificial...or glass-like....whicj is really neat, with it being inside a glass bowl.  I think you spent a lot of time with this...and it shows!</td>', 'Really nice photo!  The lighting is so interesting...combined with the B&W.  You''ve made the apple look almost artificial...or glass-like....whicj is really neat, with it being inside a glass bowl.  I think you spent a lot of time with this...and it shows!', '2004-12-31 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084369, 131120, 31214, '<td valign="top">Excellent lay-out and clors....nice job.</td>', 'Excellent lay-out and clors....nice job.', '2004-12-31 12:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084371, 131243, 31214, '<td valign="top">Great capture you''ve got here.  It works well with black and white.  My only recommendation may be to separate the pump with more space from the dark of the trees on top.  Maybe change the angle so more snow shows at the top.  Excellent display though...thanks for the chance to see it!</td>', 'Great capture you''ve got here.  It works well with black and white.  My only recommendation may be to separate the pump with more space from the dark of the trees on top.  Maybe change the angle so more snow shows at the top.  Excellent display though...thanks for the chance to see it!', '2004-12-31 12:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084374, 131287, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like the object shown here....it''s interesting to study.  Perhaps a closer view with a more interesting perspective of it.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the object shown here....it''s interesting to study.  Perhaps a closer view with a more interesting perspective of it.  Good job.', '2004-12-31 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084378, 131259, 31214, '<td valign="top">The contrast draws me in....<br/>I like the way the band on the left gets "absorbed" into the blue, but I wish the right side would do the same.  Perhaps a different light angle?</td>', 'The contrast draws me in....I like the way the band on the left gets "absorbed" into the blue, but I wish the right side would do the same.  Perhaps a different light angle?', '2004-12-31 12:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084380, 131293, 31214, '<td valign="top">All things must come to an end.  It''s a colorful garveyard though.  Did you try picking just one thing out, like that fork lift on the left, and focusing just on it?  I bet it would be interesting to see one device in more detail, with all the snow on it.</td>', 'All things must come to an end.  It''s a colorful garveyard though.  Did you try picking just one thing out, like that fork lift on the left, and focusing just on it?  I bet it would be interesting to see one device in more detail, with all the snow on it.', '2004-12-31 12:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084382, 131203, 31214, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot.  Nice choice.  Great composition.  Nice backgroud that is not distracting at all.</td>', 'I like this one a lot.  Nice choice.  Great composition.  Nice backgroud that is not distracting at all.', '2004-12-31 12:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084384, 131326, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, Might use additional prop for more interest, pencil etc.<br/>Technical: 8, Like sepia, but a bit dark in shadowed areas. Blends in with BG too much.<br/>Appeal: 6<br/>Challenge: 10<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 8</td>', 'Composition: 8, Might use additional prop for more interest, pencil etc.Technical: 8, Like sepia, but a bit dark in shadowed areas. Blends in with BG too much.Appeal: 6Challenge: 10Overall Calculated Average Score: 8', '2004-12-31 12:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1084388, 130954, 31214, '<td valign="top">Intesting perspective, but is this mechanical?  I really like the photo, it''s just the theme I''m having trouble with.  In terms of simply the picture....I love the colors, especially the different blues!</td>', 'Intesting perspective, but is this mechanical?  I really like the photo, it''s just the theme I''m having trouble with.  In terms of simply the picture....I love the colors, especially the different blues!', '2004-12-31 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
