(1084943, 130898, 24991, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I''d suggest though because this was an advanced edit challenge, you may have wanted to enhance the yellow to bring out the brillance in the brass of the turntable arm.  Just a thought though.  Great 8</td>', 'Nice.  I''d suggest though because this was an advanced edit challenge, you may have wanted to enhance the yellow to bring out the brillance in the brass of the turntable arm.  Just a thought though.  Great 8', '2004-12-31 21:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
