(1084968, 130262, 29513, '<td valign="top">The finger print is a nice touch.  (Sorry for the pun.  Maybe that sould be a New Year''s resolution but it''s not.)  <br/>Kidding aside, I like almost everything about this: framing, colors, sharpness.  Just great!</td>', 'The finger print is a nice touch.  (Sorry for the pun.  Maybe that sould be a New Year''s resolution but it''s not.)  Kidding aside, I like almost everything about this: framing, colors, sharpness.  Just great!', '2004-12-31 21:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
