(1085957, 131120, 30478, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, lighting is great, subjects are colorful.</td>', 'Nicely done, lighting is great, subjects are colorful.', '2005-01-02 00:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1085998, 130480, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the high key look of this shot. I am a fan of the extreme and artsy. The blown out whites enhance the "very mechanical" feel of this shot. I also like the dof and that the lines lead my eye to the right (future). Excellent shot and wonderful use of line and motif.  10<br/></td>', 'I love the high key look of this shot. I am a fan of the extreme and artsy. The blown out whites enhance the "very mechanical" feel of this shot. I also like the dof and that the lines lead my eye to the right (future). Excellent shot and wonderful use of line and motif.  10', '2005-01-02 01:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086005, 131309, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great use of silhouette. It adds interest to this shot. I would crop out the distracting background and perhaps just leave the top of the fence and building. The line of the subject is ominous and sinister to me.</td>', 'Great use of silhouette. It adds interest to this shot. I would crop out the distracting background and perhaps just leave the top of the fence and building. The line of the subject is ominous and sinister to me.', '2005-01-02 01:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086009, 130713, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the point of view and the shallow dof. The warm wood colors are a nice background to the metallic greys in the sharpener. The fact that it is facing left (looking to the past) enhances the feel of it being a thing of the past. Nice job. 8</td>', 'Great shot. I like the point of view and the shallow dof. The warm wood colors are a nice background to the metallic greys in the sharpener. The fact that it is facing left (looking to the past) enhances the feel of it being a thing of the past. Nice job. 8', '2005-01-02 01:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086013, 131266, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is technically a stunning shot. It is also a master composition. The brilliant use of line and the great backdrop of the wheel and spokes, further enhanced by the circle motif in the background is brilliant. The cropping is perfect. This image is one of the best in the challenge. Great shot.  10</td>', 'This is technically a stunning shot. It is also a master composition. The brilliant use of line and the great backdrop of the wheel and spokes, further enhanced by the circle motif in the background is brilliant. The cropping is perfect. This image is one of the best in the challenge. Great shot.  10', '2005-01-02 01:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086023, 130270, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great nostalgic feeling to this shot. I like the use of the woodpile as a backdrop. The dappled lighting adds so much to this shot. Since I see the wheelbarrow as a thing of the past, I would flip this horizontally to have it moving off the screen to the left to symbolize the past. I would just try it so see if it worked. It may not since the lighting from the right suggests sunset for me rather than sunrise so flipping it could mess that up. Sweet shot. 9</td>', 'Great nostalgic feeling to this shot. I like the use of the woodpile as a backdrop. The dappled lighting adds so much to this shot. Since I see the wheelbarrow as a thing of the past, I would flip this horizontally to have it moving off the screen to the left to symbolize the past. I would just try it so see if it worked. It may not since the lighting from the right suggests sunset for me rather than sunrise so flipping it could mess that up. Sweet shot. 9', '2005-01-02 01:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086035, 131302, 22384, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if you got a lot of comments about this not meeting the challenge. I don''t really care whether it does or doesn''t (considering that I see the man as your focal point); it is a stunning shot. I love the motif of the masts and the great technical work. I am impressed with the range of values and the snow. I am going to consider the mechanics being the masts and sails. Stunning work. 10</td>', 'I don''t know if you got a lot of comments about this not meeting the challenge. I don''t really care whether it does or doesn''t (considering that I see the man as your focal point); it is a stunning shot. I love the motif of the masts and the great technical work. I am impressed with the range of values and the snow. I am going to consider the mechanics being the masts and sails. Stunning work. 10', '2005-01-02 01:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086045, 130812, 22384, '<td valign="top">The depth of field and the crisp images in this shot are great. I also love the selective desaturation. Great motif of doors and windows. This is a nice change of pace from all the shiny metal in this challenge is is one of my favorites. Nice shot and processing. 10</td>', 'The depth of field and the crisp images in this shot are great. I also love the selective desaturation. Great motif of doors and windows. This is a nice change of pace from all the shiny metal in this challenge is is one of my favorites. Nice shot and processing. 10', '2005-01-02 01:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086047, 131144, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a brilliant shot. What a great find and how clever of you to have the operating instructions showing. Very nice. One of the best!  10</td>', 'This is a brilliant shot. What a great find and how clever of you to have the operating instructions showing. Very nice. One of the best!  10', '2005-01-02 01:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086056, 131194, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the rust of the metal and the grey of the old wood. The rusty nails are a nice touch. Interesting composition. 9</td>', 'I love the rust of the metal and the grey of the old wood. The rusty nails are a nice touch. Interesting composition. 9', '2005-01-02 01:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086099, 131313, 30861, '<td valign="top">DOF way off to my eye, shadows too blocked up, static composition takes me nowhere. Try it on a diagonal?</td>', 'DOF way off to my eye, shadows too blocked up, static composition takes me nowhere. Try it on a diagonal?', '2005-01-02 02:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086169, 130636, 30861, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this means, what it has to do with title, it''s chaotic to me.</td>', 'I have no idea what this means, what it has to do with title, it''s chaotic to me.', '2005-01-02 02:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
