(1086316, 130650, 27845, '<td valign="top">Seems too easy, simple. The picture doesn''t look as if you tried to do something special.<br/>It''s mechanical all right, but it doesn''t show too much of it, except for the lever at the right. The lighting is okay, the details come out well. 4.</td>', 'Seems too easy, simple. The picture doesn''t look as if you tried to do something special.It''s mechanical all right, but it doesn''t show too much of it, except for the lever at the right. The lighting is okay, the details come out well. 4.', '2005-01-02 04:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086337, 131277, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool composition. I''d have preferred a b&amp;w version. Maybe you''ll post one in the forums after the challenge. 7.</td>', 'Cool composition. I''d have preferred a b&w version. Maybe you''ll post one in the forums after the challenge. 7.', '2005-01-02 05:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086338, 130710, 27845, '<td valign="top">I''cant see why fire tool should be mechanic. I can''t see the fire tools at all! Or almost not. The picture is just too dark, the one thing you refer to can barely be seen. 2.</td>', 'I''cant see why fire tool should be mechanic. I can''t see the fire tools at all! Or almost not. The picture is just too dark, the one thing you refer to can barely be seen. 2.', '2005-01-02 05:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086347, 131280, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wohooo! I didn''t see the face at first. Great! Looks a bit oversharpened though, there''s a halo around the edges. It''s definately the face that makes me give you a 7.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-01-05 11:04:47.</i></td>', 'Wohooo! I didn''t see the face at first. Great! Looks a bit oversharpened though, there''s a halo around the edges. It''s definately the face that makes me give you a 7.', '2005-01-02 05:46:09.000000', '2005-01-05 11:04:47.000000', 1),
(1086352, 131346, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool mechanism. The picture''s too dark though. I like how the colour comes off the wheel and gear, and the wooden workbench in the background. The composition is well chosen, but you should have done something else with the light, it''s just too dark. 8.</td>', 'Cool mechanism. The picture''s too dark though. I like how the colour comes off the wheel and gear, and the wooden workbench in the background. The composition is well chosen, but you should have done something else with the light, it''s just too dark. 8.', '2005-01-02 05:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086356, 130216, 27845, '<td valign="top">I can''t see the link to the challenge. I can''t see too much of the light either. There are no interesting shadows, just darkness. 1.</td>', 'I can''t see the link to the challenge. I can''t see too much of the light either. There are no interesting shadows, just darkness. 1.', '2005-01-02 05:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086360, 131275, 27845, '<td valign="top">Ah, a Hemingway fan :) Or John Donne?<br/>Looks nice, but I''d have kept this image for another challenge. A gong is not mechanical, it''s acoustic, isn''t it? In our physics classes, there were two different chapters for each. You''ll surely tell me after the challenge if I''m wrong. A church clock would have been more mechanical, as you have to pull a rope to make it toll. Anyways, the picture is nice, but because of the weak link to the challenge, I give you a 6.</td>', 'Ah, a Hemingway fan :) Or John Donne?Looks nice, but I''d have kept this image for another challenge. A gong is not mechanical, it''s acoustic, isn''t it? In our physics classes, there were two different chapters for each. You''ll surely tell me after the challenge if I''m wrong. A church clock would have been more mechanical, as you have to pull a rope to make it toll. Anyways, the picture is nice, but because of the weak link to the challenge, I give you a 6.', '2005-01-02 06:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086364, 130456, 27845, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, but it doesn''t look mechanical. It isn''t sharp either, and in the middle there are large blown out areas. 1.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, but it doesn''t look mechanical. It isn''t sharp either, and in the middle there are large blown out areas. 1.', '2005-01-02 06:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1086366, 131208, 27845, '<td valign="top">I can''t see what'' mechanical in this. I''ll return after voting''s over to have a look at your comments. For now, I give you a 4.</td>', 'I can''t see what'' mechanical in this. I''ll return after voting''s over to have a look at your comments. For now, I give you a 4.', '2005-01-02 06:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
