(1087333, 131357, 19831, '<td valign="top">NIce idea. I like using the negative space. Certainly fits the challenge well. But IMO it needs a deeper dof to show more of the pencil. Also, i think if the pencil were not quite so far in the corner, it would balance out a little stronger.</td>', 'NIce idea. I like using the negative space. Certainly fits the challenge well. But IMO it needs a deeper dof to show more of the pencil. Also, i think if the pencil were not quite so far in the corner, it would balance out a little stronger.', '2005-01-02 18:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087340, 130811, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot IMO. I love the dof you''ve got. Your choice of perspective makes for a very strong composition. It makes for very nice leading lines, the eye follows gently along, taking in the whole photo slowly and gracefully. Your title is perfect, simple yet telling the story or point of the photo along with the snow/ice present. Good, subtle shadows add to the mood. Very nice job, one of my favorites of the field.</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot IMO. I love the dof you''ve got. Your choice of perspective makes for a very strong composition. It makes for very nice leading lines, the eye follows gently along, taking in the whole photo slowly and gracefully. Your title is perfect, simple yet telling the story or point of the photo along with the snow/ice present. Good, subtle shadows add to the mood. Very nice job, one of my favorites of the field.', '2005-01-02 18:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087341, 130954, 19831, '<td valign="top">Isn''t a lamp electrical?</td>', 'Isn''t a lamp electrical?', '2005-01-02 18:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087345, 130258, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The wood shavings are a very nice touch. Good crisp photo. I think compositionally, is pretty good, but may be improved if the bottom of the plane were not quite so close to the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'Nice shot. The wood shavings are a very nice touch. Good crisp photo. I think compositionally, is pretty good, but may be improved if the bottom of the plane were not quite so close to the bottom of the photo.', '2005-01-02 18:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087346, 130307, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Good vibrant colors. Love the title.  :-)</td>', 'Nice composition. Good vibrant colors. Love the title.  :-)', '2005-01-02 18:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087350, 130548, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of potential here for a great shot. I like the b/w. The subject is definitely on topic for the challenge. However, IMO, I find it lacking a little interest factor. It looks like there may be some good lines, and would be worth exploring different perspectives.</td>', 'I see a lot of potential here for a great shot. I like the b/w. The subject is definitely on topic for the challenge. However, IMO, I find it lacking a little interest factor. It looks like there may be some good lines, and would be worth exploring different perspectives.', '2005-01-02 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087352, 131256, 19831, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that what they call those little chocolate cake things that Little Debbie makes???  :-)   I like the snow on the wheel. Good composition.</td>', 'Isn''t that what they call those little chocolate cake things that Little Debbie makes???  :-)   I like the snow on the wheel. Good composition.', '2005-01-02 18:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087361, 130816, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Focus is good. Good lighting and the shadow works in this case. I think a different perspective may be an improvement. Perhaps capturing just the lock and the wood/door that it is on. The curtain or whatever that is in the background kind of clashes and is not to appealing IMO.</td>', 'Good idea. Focus is good. Good lighting and the shadow works in this case. I think a different perspective may be an improvement. Perhaps capturing just the lock and the wood/door that it is on. The curtain or whatever that is in the background kind of clashes and is not to appealing IMO.', '2005-01-02 18:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087367, 130829, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I like the ''S'' curves of your subject. Looks like some nice textures going on as well. Fits the challenge very well. I think an improvement may be a slightly different perspective, eliminating the post thingy in the upper left corner, it is just a tad bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea. I like the ''S'' curves of your subject. Looks like some nice textures going on as well. Fits the challenge very well. I think an improvement may be a slightly different perspective, eliminating the post thingy in the upper left corner, it is just a tad bit distracting.', '2005-01-02 18:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087372, 131318, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good idea. Nice subject and fits the challenge well. Compositionally, I don''t like how the handles are cut off. Should show the whole thing or cut off for purpose. Also I think a use of the rule of thirds would help stronger utilize the negative space and balance the photo out. Lighting is not bad, but IMO, might be better either using a fill to eliminate the shadows, or else make them more dramatic and adding to the shot.</td>', 'A good idea. Nice subject and fits the challenge well. Compositionally, I don''t like how the handles are cut off. Should show the whole thing or cut off for purpose. Also I think a use of the rule of thirds would help stronger utilize the negative space and balance the photo out. Lighting is not bad, but IMO, might be better either using a fill to eliminate the shadows, or else make them more dramatic and adding to the shot.', '2005-01-02 18:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087375, 131268, 19831, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what a reloader is, but an interesting photo. Definitely looks mechanical to me. Nice opposing lines and angles in the composition. I like the dramatic use of shadows.</td>', 'I don''t know what a reloader is, but an interesting photo. Definitely looks mechanical to me. Nice opposing lines and angles in the composition. I like the dramatic use of shadows.', '2005-01-02 19:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
