(1087708, 131220, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice view of the movement on this watch. Three things which could be improved upon: Sharpness, Lighting, Color.<br/> <br/>Not sure if the fuzziness is due to limitations of your camera''s imager, camera shake, or if was just simply off focus. In any case, I would recommend taking a few extra shots on a tripod or on a stable surface to try to get it sharper.<br/> <br/>Getting adequate lighting on jewelry and small items as this watch is quite a challenge. Appears to be shot with available light coming in from the top right. The rotation of the balance wheel and inner mechanisms such as the escapement is obscured by strong shadows. I recommend using a diffuse ilght source normal to the face of the watch.<br/> <br/>The color in this photograph is rather flat. It''s uncertain as to whether the bridges and mainspring barrel are copper in color or if it''s skewed white balance. This is tied with the choice of lighting and would probably correct itself once improved.</td>', 'Nice view of the movement on this watch. Three things which could be improved upon: Sharpness, Lighting, Color. Not sure if the fuzziness is due to limitations of your camera''s imager, camera shake, or if was just simply off focus. In any case, I would recommend taking a few extra shots on a tripod or on a stable surface to try to get it sharper. Getting adequate lighting on jewelry and small items as this watch is quite a challenge. Appears to be shot with available light coming in from the top right. The rotation of the balance wheel and inner mechanisms such as the escapement is obscured by strong shadows. I recommend using a diffuse ilght source normal to the face of the watch. The color in this photograph is rather flat. It''s uncertain as to whether the bridges and mainspring barrel are copper in color or if it''s skewed white balance. This is tied with the choice of lighting and would probably correct itself once improved.', '2005-01-02 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087709, 130316, 30214, '<td valign="top">nice find, and light is OK. The shot lacks on "drama", in my opinion. Would be good for selling it on e-bay, though :)</td>', 'nice find, and light is OK. The shot lacks on "drama", in my opinion. Would be good for selling it on e-bay, though :)', '2005-01-02 22:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
