(1087735, 130995, 19831, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot! Nothing at all negative I can say about it. Should be a top contender. Fits the challenge perfect, yet an awesome photo by it''s own right!!!</td>', 'Awesome shot! Nothing at all negative I can say about it. Should be a top contender. Fits the challenge perfect, yet an awesome photo by it''s own right!!!', '2005-01-02 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087739, 130969, 22479, '<td valign="top">Oops...watch is cropped on the left, for whatever reason you decided to. Unfortunate because it is distracting to see just a part of the watch. The chain has some very bright highlights with blue fringing (chromatic aberration) which is due to the harsh lighting. Otherwise extremely sharp, focused well, and with good color balance.</td>', 'Oops...watch is cropped on the left, for whatever reason you decided to. Unfortunate because it is distracting to see just a part of the watch. The chain has some very bright highlights with blue fringing (chromatic aberration) which is due to the harsh lighting. Otherwise extremely sharp, focused well, and with good color balance.', '2005-01-02 22:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087741, 130238, 19831, '<td valign="top">NIce idea. I really like your lighting here. The hourglass appears slightly tilted to me, I find it just a bit distracting.</td>', 'NIce idea. I really like your lighting here. The hourglass appears slightly tilted to me, I find it just a bit distracting.', '2005-01-02 22:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087750, 131031, 31185, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2005-01-02 22:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087752, 130961, 19831, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, bold statement. Strong image. A little too dark, I think. It is hard to make out detail, that is either a knife or a syringe, hard to tell. An interesting composition though.</td>', 'Hmmm, bold statement. Strong image. A little too dark, I think. It is hard to make out detail, that is either a knife or a syringe, hard to tell. An interesting composition though.', '2005-01-02 22:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087767, 130813, 19831, '<td valign="top">A nice idea. Good subject that fits the challenge nicely. I don''t like how the cork is cut off though, and the corkscrew looks slightly tilted. I think it might be better if it were either truly diagonal or evenly straight. Lighting looks kind of flat overall except for the hot glare on the left arm of the tool.</td>', 'A nice idea. Good subject that fits the challenge nicely. I don''t like how the cork is cut off though, and the corkscrew looks slightly tilted. I think it might be better if it were either truly diagonal or evenly straight. Lighting looks kind of flat overall except for the hot glare on the left arm of the tool.', '2005-01-02 22:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087793, 130822, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think you have a potentially good subject here. It fits the challenge well. Your focus definitely needs to be sharper. Perhaps you''re trying to get too close, especially if you don''t have manual focus or a macro setting. Lighting seems kind of harsh, possibly due to using built in flash? Try diffusing it or use other light sources(there are lots of cheap, homemade, or makeshift possibilities). Also it appears kind of weak compositionally. Try different perspectives or angles, using compositional guides such as diagonals, leading lines or the rule of thirds (there are tutorials on the site about these type of things). This background may work well with these other points touched upon, it looks like there is some nice texture to the wood grain, or you could try a black cloth or other simple, plain contrasting things.</td>', 'I think you have a potentially good subject here. It fits the challenge well. Your focus definitely needs to be sharper. Perhaps you''re trying to get too close, especially if you don''t have manual focus or a macro setting. Lighting seems kind of harsh, possibly due to using built in flash? Try diffusing it or use other light sources(there are lots of cheap, homemade, or makeshift possibilities). Also it appears kind of weak compositionally. Try different perspectives or angles, using compositional guides such as diagonals, leading lines or the rule of thirds (there are tutorials on the site about these type of things). This background may work well with these other points touched upon, it looks like there is some nice texture to the wood grain, or you could try a black cloth or other simple, plain contrasting things.', '2005-01-02 23:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087801, 131147, 19831, '<td valign="top">Retired??? That''s the kind of mower I have !!!  Nice composition though.  :-) Good lines and I really like the red nestled in all the green foliage.</td>', 'Retired??? That''s the kind of mower I have !!!  Nice composition though.  :-) Good lines and I really like the red nestled in all the green foliage.', '2005-01-02 23:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087806, 130559, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Good subject. I love the reflection. Lighting looks a little bit flat though... and I''m wondering if a more extreme diagonal might work a little bit better?</td>', 'Great concept. Good subject. I love the reflection. Lighting looks a little bit flat though... and I''m wondering if a more extreme diagonal might work a little bit better?', '2005-01-02 23:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1087812, 130428, 19831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Great lighting, nice detail. I love all the little punch outs. I can''t decide if the papers at the top left add to or distract from the shot, anyway no mark down from me for it. Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Great lighting, nice detail. I love all the little punch outs. I can''t decide if the papers at the top left add to or distract from the shot, anyway no mark down from me for it. Good job.', '2005-01-02 23:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
