(1088748, 130219, 25742, '<td valign="top">transportation: yes.<br/>simple: no<br/>a lot of computer design in that. <br/>Good photo anyway. I was doing this shot, I''d probably try positioning the pedals differently. How? Several suggestions: have the closer one in line with the rear rim (or wheel), have it as a continuation of the main frame down to the left or in line with the bar holding the rear wheel<br/>Happy biking</td>', 'transportation: yes.simple: noa lot of computer design in that. Good photo anyway. I was doing this shot, I''d probably try positioning the pedals differently. How? Several suggestions: have the closer one in line with the rear rim (or wheel), have it as a continuation of the main frame down to the left or in line with the bar holding the rear wheelHappy biking', '2005-01-03 13:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1088750, 130270, 25742, '<td valign="top">good idea. composition could be stronger, but since composition is my weak side I leave it to you to find another :)<br/></td>', 'good idea. composition could be stronger, but since composition is my weak side I leave it to you to find another :)', '2005-01-03 13:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
