(1089829, 131296, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice idea. I like the lighting, and good detail on the block. Fits the challenge very well, and yet is creative also. I don''t like how the block is cut off though, perhaps if you showed all the hook and a tad bit more of the bottom.</td>', 'This is a very nice idea. I like the lighting, and good detail on the block. Fits the challenge very well, and yet is creative also. I don''t like how the block is cut off though, perhaps if you showed all the hook and a tad bit more of the bottom.', '2005-01-03 22:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
