(1090381, 131212, 31485, '<td valign="top">good use of color, maybe could have used something to draw more attention to the top half, like a larger piece of fruit?</td>', 'good use of color, maybe could have used something to draw more attention to the top half, like a larger piece of fruit?', '2005-01-04 09:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090382, 130726, 31485, '<td valign="top">perfect.</td>', 'perfect.', '2005-01-04 09:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090386, 131296, 11895, '<td valign="top">I really like this, nice colors and textures, the foreground subject is crisp but doesn''t look oversharpenned.  For some reason the proportion of foreground subject to background strikes me as a bit off, needing less bg and more subject; or maybe it would look just a little bit better if the bg was closer to being in focus.  Good shot, hope it does well for you.</td>', 'I really like this, nice colors and textures, the foreground subject is crisp but doesn''t look oversharpenned.  For some reason the proportion of foreground subject to background strikes me as a bit off, needing less bg and more subject; or maybe it would look just a little bit better if the bg was closer to being in focus.  Good shot, hope it does well for you.', '2005-01-04 09:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090387, 130726, 20056, '<td valign="top">I had this idea ... but then I thought about the electromagnetic system of the nerves :)<br/>Good composition, maybe the "big" finger is a little blured...</td>', 'I had this idea ... but then I thought about the electromagnetic system of the nerves :)Good composition, maybe the "big" finger is a little blured...', '2005-01-04 09:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
