(1090848, 131278, 25758, '<td valign="top">I like the copletely black background, the ultrasharp image with only the needle slighly out of focus to indicated motion.  Catching the needle on the side of the metronome placed the body of the machine in the right side of the photo.  The arm provides a straight line and strengthens the photos.  Very good job!</td>', 'I like the copletely black background, the ultrasharp image with only the needle slighly out of focus to indicated motion.  Catching the needle on the side of the metronome placed the body of the machine in the right side of the photo.  The arm provides a straight line and strengthens the photos.  Very good job!', '2005-01-04 14:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090853, 131285, 25758, '<td valign="top">The arm reaching into the sink does not add anything to the photo in fact it detracts from the subject ... mechanical machine!   Need more action in the photo. Perhaps a low shot with the potatoes streaming out of the holes would have been more dramatic.   Good subject but needs work.</td>', 'The arm reaching into the sink does not add anything to the photo in fact it detracts from the subject ... mechanical machine!   Need more action in the photo. Perhaps a low shot with the potatoes streaming out of the holes would have been more dramatic.   Good subject but needs work.', '2005-01-04 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090861, 131360, 25758, '<td valign="top">This an excellant foto but I prefer the subject to be easier to recognize.  The light bouning off the water as it disappears.  The chain on the left adds to the recognition of the photo.  Good photo.</td>', 'This an excellant foto but I prefer the subject to be easier to recognize.  The light bouning off the water as it disappears.  The chain on the left adds to the recognition of the photo.  Good photo.', '2005-01-04 15:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1090863, 130963, 25758, '<td valign="top">This is a vivid foto of the practice session.  The metronome goes tick, tick, tick and the guitar goes plunk, plunk, plunk.   I visualize a beginer practicing, practicing and practicing!  The eye is drawn to the metronome and then travels down the guitar to the hands.     Excellant foto.</td>', 'This is a vivid foto of the practice session.  The metronome goes tick, tick, tick and the guitar goes plunk, plunk, plunk.   I visualize a beginer practicing, practicing and practicing!  The eye is drawn to the metronome and then travels down the guitar to the hands.     Excellant foto.', '2005-01-04 15:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
