(1091551, 130639, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and interesting colors, though they somehow don'' look natural given the split and transition  (I am not assuming they are PSd, just noting that''s my impression).  Compositionally, I think the angle of the blades would work better without a centered composition (or maybe if it were shot head on).  It almost presents itself like a geometric abstract, so I can''t help but wonder if this might have been improved by excluding the little bit of ground presented.</td>', 'Very nice, and interesting colors, though they somehow don'' look natural given the split and transition  (I am not assuming they are PSd, just noting that''s my impression).  Compositionally, I think the angle of the blades would work better without a centered composition (or maybe if it were shot head on).  It almost presents itself like a geometric abstract, so I can''t help but wonder if this might have been improved by excluding the little bit of ground presented.', '2005-01-04 22:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091554, 131254, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the balls in motion, though I wish they were a bit more visible.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Nice capture of the balls in motion, though I wish they were a bit more visible.  Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091558, 130893, 19708, '<td valign="top">Simply a superb job on the lighting and composition.<br/>One of my top picks in this Challenge.<br/>Mixed feelings on the border, but took nothing away for it.</td>', 'Simply a superb job on the lighting and composition.One of my top picks in this Challenge.Mixed feelings on the border, but took nothing away for it.', '2005-01-04 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091562, 130986, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Good tones and lighting.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Good tones and lighting.  Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 23:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091565, 131266, 25464, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge nicely.  Interesting lines and hint of color.</td>', 'Fits the challenge nicely.  Interesting lines and hint of color.', '2005-01-04 23:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091569, 131274, 25464, '<td valign="top">Lots of trains entered, but I like the angle taken here.  Good job.</td>', 'Lots of trains entered, but I like the angle taken here.  Good job.', '2005-01-04 23:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091572, 130663, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the angle and colors.  I don''t know what the brown object is upper right, but it is to me inconsistent with the wonderful color scheme here, and detracts a bit from the mood set.  It would be nice to try and exclude that!  But I like it overall.  Bumping up.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the angle and colors.  I don''t know what the brown object is upper right, but it is to me inconsistent with the wonderful color scheme here, and detracts a bit from the mood set.  It would be nice to try and exclude that!  But I like it overall.  Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 23:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091573, 130945, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good macro and very nice tones.   Bumping up.</td>', 'Good macro and very nice tones.   Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 23:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091575, 130694, 25464, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  The reflections on teh wet concrete are a nice touch.  My only complaint is the beam on the far left.  The angle makes it appear to be leaning.  I think I would have cropped a bit tighter to leave just the edge in the frame and elminiate the rivets, or maybe remove it altogether.  Otherwise, interesting colorful shot.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  The reflections on teh wet concrete are a nice touch.  My only complaint is the beam on the far left.  The angle makes it appear to be leaning.  I think I would have cropped a bit tighter to leave just the edge in the frame and elminiate the rivets, or maybe remove it altogether.  Otherwise, interesting colorful shot.  Good job.', '2005-01-04 23:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091577, 130660, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good use of Sepia.   Bumping up.</td>', 'Good use of Sepia.   Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 23:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091579, 130335, 19708, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments &amp; bump.<br/>The lighting and composition here are first-rate.<br/>Only minor (and I mean minor) dig is the green paint on the handle, but took nothing away because of it. ((8))</td>', 'Returning for comments & bump.The lighting and composition here are first-rate.Only minor (and I mean minor) dig is the green paint on the handle, but took nothing away because of it. ((8))', '2005-01-04 23:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091585, 131016, 25464, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge well and is taken at an interesting angle.  The slightly blurred focus adds motion to the shot, which is appropriate.  I think the border is hideous, but goes perfectly with the subject.  All and all it is a well taken photo that kinda creeps me out :)  Bumping up.</td>', 'This fits the challenge well and is taken at an interesting angle.  The slightly blurred focus adds motion to the shot, which is appropriate.  I think the border is hideous, but goes perfectly with the subject.  All and all it is a well taken photo that kinda creeps me out :)  Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 23:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091587, 130307, 19708, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>Superb lighting &amp; detail.<br/>Mixed feelings about edges of table, but took nothing away on it.</td>', 'Returning for comments.Superb lighting & detail.Mixed feelings about edges of table, but took nothing away on it.', '2005-01-04 23:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091588, 131191, 3306, '<td valign="top">Simply just a well taken picture. One of my favorites of this challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Simply just a well taken picture. One of my favorites of this challenge. Good luck.', '2005-01-04 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091589, 131314, 25464, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge well, but I don''t think black and white adds anything to this shot.  The centered composition is a bit too much for such a simple subject.</td>', 'This fits the challenge well, but I don''t think black and white adds anything to this shot.  The centered composition is a bit too much for such a simple subject.', '2005-01-04 23:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091591, 130707, 12253, '<td valign="top">I love motion shots, and this is well done.  It would be nice to have the horses head really sharp, but this still works well.  I like the angle you chose here too.   Bumping up.</td>', 'I love motion shots, and this is well done.  It would be nice to have the horses head really sharp, but this still works well.  I like the angle you chose here too.   Bumping up.', '2005-01-04 23:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091595, 130988, 25754, '<td valign="top">:)</td>', ':)', '2005-01-04 23:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1091596, 131349, 30818, '<td valign="top">Looks like she''s carrying a girl :)</td>', 'Looks like she''s carrying a girl :)', '2005-01-04 23:13:53.000000', NULL, 1);
