(1091676, 131119, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  I might mention that I am partial to PSE as I used to shoot tournament archery with in the unlimited free style division using a PSE Laser.   That was a long time ago....</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  I might mention that I am partial to PSE as I used to shoot tournament archery with in the unlimited free style division using a PSE Laser.   That was a long time ago....', '2005-01-04 23:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
