(1092851, 130501, 6845, '<td valign="top">I am surprised how many people score low because of the over all size. Yes you might have been able to make it bigger, but I don''t feel it was too small. Anyway, I just wanted to say that I really liked this shot and I figured it would have scored higher than this. But in any case great shot. I like the processing technique you used. It looks almost like a transformation from the time in which it exsists now to what it used to be. Good luck in a future challenges. I have added this to my favorites.</td>', 'I am surprised how many people score low because of the over all size. Yes you might have been able to make it bigger, but I don''t feel it was too small. Anyway, I just wanted to say that I really liked this shot and I figured it would have scored higher than this. But in any case great shot. I like the processing technique you used. It looks almost like a transformation from the time in which it exsists now to what it used to be. Good luck in a future challenges. I have added this to my favorites.', '2005-01-05 12:42:51.000000', NULL, 0),
