(1093251, 131173, 30983, '<td valign="top">From the placing of this piece, we can deduce one thing: DPchallenge users are fucking morons. <br/> <br/>I was the only person who gave this a 10, apperently. I absolutely love this shot. It''s a very interesting and unique photo, which is more than I can say for about more than I can say for about 240 of the other submissions. Just look at the fucking comments to see what  i''m talking about. "I don''t understand what this is! Why don''t you just take a picture of a watch?" Jesus christ these people should be shot.<br/> <br/>Great job, and don''t let this placing discourage you.</td>', 'From the placing of this piece, we can deduce one thing: DPchallenge users are fucking morons.  I was the only person who gave this a 10, apperently. I absolutely love this shot. It''s a very interesting and unique photo, which is more than I can say for about more than I can say for about 240 of the other submissions. Just look at the fucking comments to see what  i''m talking about. "I don''t understand what this is! Why don''t you just take a picture of a watch?" Jesus christ these people should be shot. Great job, and don''t let this placing discourage you.', '2005-01-05 15:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
