(1093292, 131191, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m really pleased to see this image win. It SO stood out from most of the others for its much more meditative approach to the challenge. It tells a "mechanical" story very well, and adds a purity of composition<br/>and tonality that makes it stand out as a "pure" photograph. Well done!<br/> <br/>Robt.</td>', 'I''m really pleased to see this image win. It SO stood out from most of the others for its much more meditative approach to the challenge. It tells a "mechanical" story very well, and adds a purity of compositionand tonality that makes it stand out as a "pure" photograph. Well done! Robt.', '2005-01-05 16:01:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093362, 130699, 17850, '<td valign="top">As electronics include devices with components such as resistors, capacitors, transistors, diodes, integrated circuits, which are operating at low currents (mA or ìA), it is clear that the shot didnt miss the meaning of the challenge. Ive tried to show a part of a cars engine which is electro-mechanical (not electronic of course, not exclusively electrical also). Electrical and electronic are related terms but strictly different for the engineers.</td>', 'As electronics include devices with components such as resistors, capacitors, transistors, diodes, integrated circuits, which are operating at low currents (mA or ìA), it is clear that the shot didnt miss the meaning of the challenge. Ive tried to show a part of a cars engine which is electro-mechanical (not electronic of course, not exclusively electrical also). Electrical and electronic are related terms but strictly different for the engineers.', '2005-01-05 16:33:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093400, 130961, 20779, '<td valign="top">Incredible vision to create this moving image. I think it may have scored lower due to its impact being the emotional rather than the mechanical. I will go with this any day.</td>', 'Incredible vision to create this moving image. I think it may have scored lower due to its impact being the emotional rather than the mechanical. I will go with this any day.', '2005-01-05 16:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093404, 130896, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very striking abstract. I love the haze left over the numbers.</td>', 'Very striking abstract. I love the haze left over the numbers.', '2005-01-05 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093406, 130995, 26308, '<td valign="top">This was my top pick in the challenge.  Just wanted to say congrats on the very well done image.  I don''t often spend a lot of time looking at images during voting after I''ve voted, but I kept coming back to this one over and over thinking, "How did they DO that?".  Very nicely done, again, and obviously a lot of effort and time was put into this image and it shows!  This is definitely going into my favorites.</td>', 'This was my top pick in the challenge.  Just wanted to say congrats on the very well done image.  I don''t often spend a lot of time looking at images during voting after I''ve voted, but I kept coming back to this one over and over thinking, "How did they DO that?".  Very nicely done, again, and obviously a lot of effort and time was put into this image and it shows!  This is definitely going into my favorites.', '2005-01-05 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093413, 131144, 20779, '<td valign="top">WOW is all I can say. How this scored below 6 is a mystery to me. Precision of detail and lighting are amazing and the composition near perfect. Excellent piece of work that has polish and grit.</td>', 'WOW is all I can say. How this scored below 6 is a mystery to me. Precision of detail and lighting are amazing and the composition near perfect. Excellent piece of work that has polish and grit.', '2005-01-05 17:01:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093541, 130216, 31036, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jduffett:</b></div><hr/><i> Am I missing something? I''m a mechanical engineer--if there is something mechanical in this photo you''d hope I''d be able to pick it out... I don''t see it here, sorry... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>To all of you with similar comments, I want to refer back to DPChallenge''s definition of "mechanical," which was something along the lines of "Something that doesn''t require electricity as means of operation..." Yes, to me "mechanical" is not a candle. I based it on DPChallenges definition, and wanted to be unique. I was under the impression that a concept of any art is to think outside of the box and express the rules in a new way- in your own way. I''m having trouble understanding why so many of you found this unacceptable. Maybe it''s because this was the first challenege I participated in?</td>', 'Originally posted by jduffett: Am I missing something? I''m a mechanical engineer--if there is something mechanical in this photo you''d hope I''d be able to pick it out... I don''t see it here, sorry...   To all of you with similar comments, I want to refer back to DPChallenge''s definition of "mechanical," which was something along the lines of "Something that doesn''t require electricity as means of operation..." Yes, to me "mechanical" is not a candle. I based it on DPChallenges definition, and wanted to be unique. I was under the impression that a concept of any art is to think outside of the box and express the rules in a new way- in your own way. I''m having trouble understanding why so many of you found this unacceptable. Maybe it''s because this was the first challenege I participated in?', '2005-01-05 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093551, 131317, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congrats Yura.  Quality work as usual.<br/>Happy new year.</td>', 'Congrats Yura.  Quality work as usual.Happy new year.', '2005-01-05 18:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1093632, 130963, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice!  A metronome was a perfect idea, and adding the person playing was a good touch so it''s not a simple still life.  In fact, I thought I wrote that comment during the challenge, but I see it didn''t take!<br/> <br/>I should add that I thought about shooting a metronome as well, except ours is electronic!<br/> <br/>Is that you playing?</td>', 'Nice!  A metronome was a perfect idea, and adding the person playing was a good touch so it''s not a simple still life.  In fact, I thought I wrote that comment during the challenge, but I see it didn''t take! I should add that I thought about shooting a metronome as well, except ours is electronic! Is that you playing?', '2005-01-05 19:25:15.000000', NULL, 0),
