(1093694, 130318, 29404, '<td valign="top">thank u all for ur comments ...specialy mr or ms "Gatorguy"...ur comment was more than helpfull and  so enlighting  ....and for mr "gloda"...the blue was areal life light done through a blue filter darkened with more water color...and the yelow and red was added togive it a kick...i don''t see any thing wrong with my bordere i love it the way it is ...am not feeling bad for not winning and first posissions...cuase i know i did good with that work but it seems that people on that site got used to give hight ratting to repeated ideas and to people they know...what ever that does not bother me...thank u so much for following up with my work hope to see some of ur;s ...happy new year to all of u guys...''Gator guy...try to have some fun...and good luck</td>', 'thank u all for ur comments ...specialy mr or ms "Gatorguy"...ur comment was more than helpfull and  so enlighting  ....and for mr "gloda"...the blue was areal life light done through a blue filter darkened with more water color...and the yelow and red was added togive it a kick...i don''t see any thing wrong with my bordere i love it the way it is ...am not feeling bad for not winning and first posissions...cuase i know i did good with that work but it seems that people on that site got used to give hight ratting to repeated ideas and to people they know...what ever that does not bother me...thank u so much for following up with my work hope to see some of ur;s ...happy new year to all of u guys...''Gator guy...try to have some fun...and good luck', '2005-01-05 19:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
