(1096413, 130651, 255, '<td valign="top">the lighting here is superb. the tone and feel reminds me of any old movie i watched in my film classes--and the reflection of (i assume) the lighting set-up in the lens furthers the feeling of an old movie set. you have a great eye--we''ll be looking for more good stuff from you! :)</td>', 'the lighting here is superb. the tone and feel reminds me of any old movie i watched in my film classes--and the reflection of (i assume) the lighting set-up in the lens furthers the feeling of an old movie set. you have a great eye--we''ll be looking for more good stuff from you! :)', '2005-01-07 21:15:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1096790, 131220, 25024, '<td valign="top">many thanks for your comments, folks. Believe it or not I did not want a too sharp image I wanted to try and emphasize a bit of antiquity (even though its a modern watch). I was obviously not too successful but its all part of the learning process.</td>', 'many thanks for your comments, folks. Believe it or not I did not want a too sharp image I wanted to try and emphasize a bit of antiquity (even though its a modern watch). I was obviously not too successful but its all part of the learning process.', '2005-01-08 05:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
