(1102582, 130318, 18799, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Halim:</b></div><hr/><i> mr gatorguy...thanks for the concern...who said i thought that this was "one"?...i can see that this is "I"...but what i didn''t see is a helpfull comment  ur comment was just  "I"...which made me wondering...what does it means...so i left u that notice ...and i realy don''t mind if any one left me a "1" cuase that is up to ur taste and i have nothing to do with it...hope every thing is clear now Mr.    ....regards..and thank u again </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Fair enough, it was just a misunderstanding all the way around.</td>', 'Originally posted by Halim: mr gatorguy...thanks for the concern...who said i thought that this was "one"?...i can see that this is "I"...but what i didn''t see is a helpfull comment  ur comment was just  "I"...which made me wondering...what does it means...so i left u that notice ...and i realy don''t mind if any one left me a "1" cuase that is up to ur taste and i have nothing to do with it...hope every thing is clear now Mr.    ....regards..and thank u again   Fair enough, it was just a misunderstanding all the way around.', '2005-01-11 23:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
