(1449302, 131246, 16053, '<td valign="top">I like the picture a lot. It''s very good and well thought. But the thing I like the moust is the description of the all photographic process. An inspiration to all the people that don''t put any information about their photos. Congratulations.</td>', 'I like the picture a lot. It''s very good and well thought. But the thing I like the moust is the description of the all photographic process. An inspiration to all the people that don''t put any information about their photos. Congratulations.', '2005-06-12 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1518909, 131019, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the blue tones to this one, but I think there are too many distracting elements in front of and around the cool looking smoke.   I read an article on photography composition once that said the first rule of thumb is to always remove clutter.  anything that''s not important to the picture, if possible, get it out of the picture.   But I really love the contrast of the colors and that beautiful blue.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the blue tones to this one, but I think there are too many distracting elements in front of and around the cool looking smoke.   I read an article on photography composition once that said the first rule of thumb is to always remove clutter.  anything that''s not important to the picture, if possible, get it out of the picture.   But I really love the contrast of the colors and that beautiful blue. ', '2005-07-08 14:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
